        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Derived from a Reactome Complex. Here is Reactomes nested structure for this complex: (P23511, Q13952, P25208). Reactome uses a nested structure for complexes, which cannot be fully represented in SBML Level 3 Version 1 core</p>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">NF-Y is a ubiquitous heterotrimeric transcription factor comprising subunits NF-Y A, NF-Y B, and NF-Y C. It binds the sequence CCAAT.</p>
