          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">This CandidateSet contains sequences identified by William Pearson's analysis of Reactome catalyst entities. Catalyst entity sequences were used to identify analagous sequences that shared overall homology and active site homology. Sequences in this Candidate set were identified in an April 24, 2012 analysis. Further candidates were identified by Ralf Stephan in a July 15, 2023 analysis.</p>
        </notes>
