      <reaction compartment="compartment_17957" fast="false" id="reaction_2066785" metaid="metaid_1803" name="Retranslocation of DHA back to ER" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">DHA is transported back to the ER, where it is incorporated into membrane lipids instead of being further beta-oxidized in the peroxisome (Ferdinandusse et al. 2003).</p>
        </notes>
