      <reaction compartment="compartment_876" fast="false" id="reaction_6809944" metaid="metaid_1810" name="PI(3,5)P2 is dephosphorylated to PI5P by the MTMR2:SBF2 tetramer at the plasma membrane" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Formation of a complex with SBF2 (MTMR13) dramatically increases phosphatidylinositol-(3,5)-bisphosphate 3-phosphatase catalytic activity of MTMR2. Since SBF2 sequesters MTRM2 from endosome membranes, the MTMR2 presumably acts on the plasma membrane-associated substrate (Berger et al. 2006).</p>
        </notes>
