      <reaction compartment="compartment_70101" fast="false" id="reaction_2161950" metaid="metaid_1812" name="Arachidonate is oxidised to 12R-HpETE by ALOX12B" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">The arachidonate 12-lipoxygenase, 12R-type (ALOX12B) oxidises arachidonate to 12R-hydroperoxy-eicosatetraenoate (12R-HpETE) (Boeglin et al. 1998).</p>
        </notes>
