      <reaction compartment="compartment_12045" fast="false" id="reaction_9945804" metaid="metaid_1815" name="HSD17B7 reduces 5a-cholest-8-en-3-one to ZYMSTNL" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">HSD17B7 (3-keto-steroid reductase/17-beta-hydroxysteroid dehydrogenase 7), in the endoplasmic reticulum membrane, reduces 5alpha-cholest-8-en-3-one to ZYMSTNL (zymostenol, 5alpha-cholest-8-en-3beta-ol) (Marijanovic et al. 2003).</p>
        </notes>
