      <reaction compartment="compartment_70101" fast="false" id="reaction_9032021" metaid="metaid_1818" name="RvT1-4 translocate from cytosol to extracellular region" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">To produce their pro-resolving effects, 13(R)-resolvins RvT1-4 are released into the exudate of local inflammation sites (Dalli et al. 2015, Walker et al. 2017). The mechanism of translocation is unknown.</p>
        </notes>
