      <reaction compartment="compartment_70101" fast="false" id="reaction_1483159" metaid="metaid_1819" name="PCho is dephosphorylated to Cho by PHOSPHO1" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">In the cytosol, the phosphoethanolamine/phosphocholine phosphatase (PHOSPHO1) dephosphorylates phosphocholine (PCho) to choline (Cho) (Roberts et al. 2004).</p>
        </notes>
