      <reaction compartment="compartment_5460" fast="false" id="reaction_73916" metaid="metaid_1820" name="2 acetyl-CoA &lt;=&gt; acetoacetyl-CoA + CoA" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Acetyl-CoA acetyltransferase tetramer (ACAT1) in the mitochondrial matrix catalyzes the reversible reaction of two molecules of acetyl-CoA to form acetoacetyl-CoA and CoA (Middleton et al. 1986).</p>
        </notes>
        <annotation>
