      <reaction compartment="compartment_70101" fast="false" id="reaction_9024997" metaid="metaid_1830" name="ALOX5 oxidises 14(S)-Hp-DHA to 7(S),14(S)-diHp-DHA" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">In macrophages, lipoxygenase 5 (ALOX5) is proposed to further oxygenate 14(S)-hydroperoxy-docosahexaenoic acid (14(S)-Hp-DHA) to 7(S),14(S)-dihydroperoxy-docosaheaenoic acid (7(S),14(S)-diHp-DHA) (Serhan et al. 2009).</p>
        </notes>
