      <reaction compartment="compartment_70101" fast="false" id="reaction_2161907" metaid="metaid_1835" name="ALOX5 oxidises 15R-HETE to 15epi-LXA4/B4" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Arachidonate 5-lipoxygenase (ALOX5) converts 15R-hydro-eicosatetraenoic acid (15R-HETE) to the epi-lipoxins, 15epi-lipoxin A4 (15epi-LXA4) and 15epi-lipoxin B4 (15epi-LXB4) (Claria and Serhan 1995). These epi-lipoxins have altered configuration at the C-15 hydroxyl but similar biological potency.</p>
        </notes>
        <annotation>
          <rdf:RDF xmlns:rdf="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/" xmlns:vCard="http://www.w3.org/2001/vcard-rdf/3.0#" xmlns:dcterms="http://purl.org/dc/terms/" xmlns:bqbiol="http://biomodels.net/biology-qualifiers/">
