      <reaction compartment="compartment_7660" fast="false" id="reaction_1655823" metaid="metaid_1837" name="Expression of Isopentenyl-diphosphate Delta-isomerase 1 (IDI1)" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">The IDI1 gene is transcribed to yield mRNA and the mRNA is translated to yield protein. SREBF1A (SREBP1A) and SREBF2 (SREBP2) bind the promoter of the Isopentenyl-diphosphate Delta-isomerase 1 (IDI1) gene and enhance transcription (Sakakura et al. 2001, Reed et al. 2008, reviewed in Horton et al. 2002).</p>
        </notes>
