      <reaction compartment="compartment_12045" fast="false" id="reaction_6807055" metaid="metaid_1842" name="DHCR7 reduces 7-dehydroCHOL to CHOL" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">DHCR7 (7-dehydrocholesterol reductase) associated with the endoplasmic reticulum membrane reduces 7-dehydroCHOL (7-dehydrocholesterol) to CHOL (cholesterol) (Kandutsch and Russell1960; Mitsche et al. 2015; Moebius et al. 1998).</p>
        </notes>
