      <reaction compartment="compartment_171062" fast="false" id="reaction_8871366" metaid="metaid_1847" name="p-Y389,400-RUFY1 binds RAB4A:GTP, RAB5:GTP, RAB14:GTP" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">RUN and FYVE domain-containing protein 1 (RUFY1, aka RABIP4, ZFYVE12), together with Ras-related proteins RAB4A, 5 and 14, could play an important role in GLUT4 trafficking in adipocytes and skeletal muscle (Kitagishi and Matsuda 2013, Larance et al. 2005, Mari et al. 2006, Fouraux et al. 2004, Yamamoto et al. 2010).</p>
        </notes>
