      <reaction compartment="compartment_20699" fast="false" id="reaction_1655851" metaid="metaid_1854" name="S2P hydrolyzes SREBP1A,1C,2" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">S2P(MBTPS2), a membrane-bound protease in the Golgi, cleaves within the transmembrane region of SREBP1A/1C/2 (SREBF1A/1C/2), releasing the N-terminal domain of SREBP1A/1C/2 into the cytosol.</p>
        </notes>
