      <reaction compartment="compartment_70101" fast="false" id="reaction_9032327" metaid="metaid_1857" name="5-oxo-EPA, 15d-PGJ3 translocate from cytosol to extracellular region" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">To produce their pro-resolving effects, 5-oxo-EPA and 15d-PGJ3 are released into the exudate of local inflammation sites (Cipollina 2015). The mechanism of translocation is unknown.</p>
        </notes>
