      <reaction compartment="compartment_70101" fast="false" id="reaction_193068" metaid="metaid_1858" name="CYP17A1 17-hydroxylates PREG" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Pregnenolone (PREG) and NADPH + H+ react to form 17alpha-hydroxypregnenolone (17aHPREG), NADP+, and H2O. Steroid 17 alpha hydroxylase/17,20 lyase (CYP17A1), associated with the endoplasmic reticulum membrane, catalyzes this reaction.</p>
        </notes>
