      <reaction compartment="compartment_70101" fast="false" id="reaction_163402" metaid="metaid_1861" name="diacylglycerol + H2O -&gt; 2-acylglycerol + fatty acid" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Rat HSL catalyzes the hydrolysis of diacylglycerol to yield 2-acylglycerol + fatty acid (Fredrikson and Belfrage 1983). The human event has not been studied in detail and is inferred from the rat one.</p>
        </notes>
