      <reaction compartment="compartment_70101" fast="false" id="reaction_9032054" metaid="metaid_1864" name="LXA4/B4 translocate from cytosol to extracellular region" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">lipoxin A4 (LXA4) and B4 (LXB4) are released to the extracellular region by an unknown mechanism (Samuelsson et al. 1987).</p>
