      <reaction compartment="compartment_12045" fast="false" id="reaction_2161792" metaid="metaid_1867" name="20cho-LTB4 is oxidised to 20cooh-LTB4 by CYP4F2/4F3" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">The cytochrome P450s 4F2 (CYP4F2) and F3 (CYP4F3) oxidise 20-aldehyde leukotriene B4 (20cho-LTB4) to form 20-carboxy leukotriene B4 (20cooh-LTB4) (Soberman et al. 1988).</p>
        </notes>
