      <reaction compartment="compartment_7660" fast="false" id="reaction_2426164" metaid="metaid_1872" name="SREBP1A,2 binds the SC5DL promoter" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">SREBP1A (SREBF1A) or SREBP2, together with NF-Y, bind and transactivate the promoter of the SC5DL gene (Reed et al. 2008, Rome et al. 2008).</p>
        </notes>
        <annotation>
