      <reaction compartment="compartment_876" fast="false" id="reaction_1676134" metaid="metaid_1877" name="PI3P is phosphorylated to PI(3,5)P2 by PIP5K1A/B at the plasma membrane" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">At the plasma membrane, phosphatidylinositol-4-phosphate 5-kinase type-1 alpha (PIP5K1A) and beta (PIP5K1B) phosphorylate phosphatidylinositol 3-phosphate (PI3P) to phosphatidylinositol 3,5-bisphosphate (PI(3,5)P2) (Tolias et al. 1998).</p>
        </notes>
        <annotation>
