      <reaction compartment="compartment_70101" fast="false" id="reaction_6810030" metaid="metaid_1879" name="MTMR2 binds MTMR10" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Based on a high throughput study of human interactome in HeLa cells, MTMR2 forms a complex with MTMR10, an enzymatically inactive myotubularin family member. The function of this complex has not been examined (Hein et al. 2015).</p>
        </notes>
