      <reaction compartment="compartment_5460" fast="false" id="reaction_193460" metaid="metaid_1880" name="3alpha, 7alpha-dihydroxy-5beta-cholestan-26-al is oxidized to 3alpha, 7alpha-dihydroxy-5beta-cholestanoate (DHCA)" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">3alpha, 7alpha-dihydroxy-5beta-cholestan-26-al, NADPH + H+, and O2 react to form 3alpha, 7alpha-dihydroxy-5beta-cholestanoate (DHCA), NADP+ and H2O. This oxidation reaction occurs in the mitochondrial matrix, catalyzed by CYP27A1.</p>
        </notes>
