      <reaction compartment="compartment_74700" fast="false" id="reaction_9840579" metaid="metaid_1887" name="GM1 localizes to ILV membrane" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">As the late endosome becomes a lysosome, inward budding of the lysosomal membrane creates intralysosomal luminal vesicles (ILV) that carry lipids, including GM1, on their outside (reviewed by Sandhoff and Sandhoff, 2018).</p>
        </notes>
        <annotation>
          <rdf:RDF xmlns:rdf="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/" xmlns:vCard="http://www.w3.org/2001/vcard-rdf/3.0#" xmlns:dcterms="http://purl.org/dc/terms/" xmlns:bqbiol="http://biomodels.net/biology-qualifiers/">
