      <reaction compartment="compartment_7660" fast="false" id="reaction_2426153" metaid="metaid_1889" name="SREBP1A,1C binds the ACACB promoter" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">SREBP1A (SREBF1A) or SREBP1C, together with SP1, bind and transactivate promoter II of the ACACB gene in human HepG2 cells (Oh et al. 2003).</p>
        </notes>
