      <reaction compartment="compartment_70101" fast="false" id="reaction_9024624" metaid="metaid_1892" name="Hydroperoxy reductase reduces 4(S)-Hp-17(R)-HDHA to AT-RvD6" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">An unknown reductase mediates the reduction of 4(S)-hydroperoxy-17(R)-hydroxydocosahexaenoic acid (4(S)-Hp-17(R)-HDHA) to 4(S),17(R)-dihydroxydocosahexaenoic acid (AT-RvD6) (Serhan et al. 2002).</p>
