      <reaction compartment="compartment_7660" fast="false" id="reaction_2426158" metaid="metaid_1893" name="SREBP1A,1C binds the GPAM promoter" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">SREBP1A (SREBF1A) or SREBP1C bind and transactivate promoter II of the GPAM gene (Harada et al. 2012). Promoter II is active in lipogenic tissues. As inferred from mouse, NF-Y also binds the GPAM promoter with SREBP1A/1C.</p>
        </notes>
