      <reaction compartment="compartment_984" fast="false" id="reaction_9733545" metaid="metaid_1894" name="Bile salts and acids bind ALB" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Bile salts and acids are transported in the blood primarily bound to serum albumin (ALB) (Rudman and Kendall 1957, Roda et al. 1982).</p>
        </notes>
        <annotation>
