      <reaction compartment="compartment_5460" fast="false" id="reaction_77301" metaid="metaid_1898" name="trans-Hexadec-2-enoyl-CoA+H2O =&gt; (S)-3-Hydroxyhexadecanoyl-CoA" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Trifunctional protein in the mitochondrial matrix hydrates trans-hexadec-2-enoyl-CoA to form (S)-3-hydroxyhexadecanoyl-CoA (Carpenter et al. 1992).</p>
        </notes>
        <annotation>
          <rdf:RDF xmlns:rdf="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/" xmlns:vCard="http://www.w3.org/2001/vcard-rdf/3.0#" xmlns:dcterms="http://purl.org/dc/terms/" xmlns:bqmodel="http://biomodels.net/model-qualifiers/" xmlns:bqbiol="http://biomodels.net/biology-qualifiers/">
            <rdf:Description rdf:about="#metaid_1898">
