      <reaction compartment="compartment_70101" fast="false" id="reaction_9031856" metaid="metaid_1902" name="Sulfido conjugates translocate from cytosol to extracellular region" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">To produce their pro-resolving effects, DHA-derived sulfido conjugates (MCTR1-3, PCTR1-3 and RCTR1-3) are released into the exudate of local inflammation sites (Dalli et al. 2015, 2016). The mechanism of translocation is unknown.</p>
        </notes>
