      <reaction compartment="compartment_7660" fast="false" id="reaction_560473" metaid="metaid_1907" name="Expression of ANGPTL4" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">The ANGPTL4 gene is transcribed to yield mRNA and the mRNA is translated to yield protein. The PPARG:RXRA heterodimer bound to fatty acids activates transcription of the ANGPTL4 gene. The PPARG:RXRA heterodimer binds the promoter of the ANGPTL4 gene.</p>
        </notes>
