      <reaction compartment="compartment_5460" fast="false" id="reaction_109338" metaid="metaid_1909" name="Isomerization of cis,cis-3,6-Dodecadienoyl-CoA to form trans,cis-Lauro-2,6-dienoyl-CoA" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">At the beginning of this reaction, 1 molecule of 'cis,cis-3,6-Dodecadienoyl-CoA' is present. At the end of this reaction, 1 molecule of 'trans,cis-Lauro-2,6-dienoyl-CoA ' is present. This reaction takes place in the 'mitochondrial matrix' and is mediated by the 'dodecenoyl-CoA delta-isomerase activity' of '3,2-trans-enoyl-CoA isomerase Homodimer'.</p>
        </notes>
        <annotation>
          <rdf:RDF xmlns:rdf="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/" xmlns:vCard="http://www.w3.org/2001/vcard-rdf/3.0#" xmlns:dcterms="http://purl.org/dc/terms/" xmlns:bqbiol="http://biomodels.net/biology-qualifiers/">
