      <reaction compartment="compartment_7660" fast="false" id="reaction_1655833" metaid="metaid_1912" name="Expression of TM7SF2" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">The TM7SF2 gene is transcribed to yield mRNA and the mRNA is translated to yield protein. SREBF2 (SREBP2) binds the promoter of the TM7SF2 gene and enhances transcription (Bennati et al. 2006, Schiavone et al. 2010).</p>
        </notes>
        <annotation>
          <rdf:RDF xmlns:rdf="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/" xmlns:vCard="http://www.w3.org/2001/vcard-rdf/3.0#" xmlns:dcterms="http://purl.org/dc/terms/" xmlns:bqbiol="http://biomodels.net/biology-qualifiers/">
