      <reaction compartment="compartment_5460" fast="false" id="reaction_77299" metaid="metaid_1915" name="palmitoyl-CoA+FAD =&gt; trans-Hexadec-2-enoyl-CoA+FADH2" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">VLCAD in the mitochondrial matrix dehydrogenates palmitoyl-CoA to form trans-hexadec-2-enoyl-CoA (Krane and Beinert 1956; Kelley 1992).</p>
        </notes>
