      <reaction compartment="compartment_70101" fast="false" id="reaction_9020249" metaid="metaid_1918" name="Hydroperoxy reductase reduces 4(S)-Hp-17(S)-HDHA to RvD6" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">An unknown hydroperoxy reductase mediates the reduction of 4(S)-hydroperoxy-17(S)-hydroxydocosahexaenoic acid (4(S)-Hp-17(S)-HDHA) to 4(S),17(S)-dihydroxydocosahexaenoic acid (AT-RvD6) (Serhan et al. 2002).</p>
        </notes>
