      <reaction compartment="compartment_17951" fast="false" id="reaction_193533" metaid="metaid_1921" name="Thiolysis of 3alpha,7alpha-dihydroxy-5beta-cholan-24-one-CoA yields chenodeoxycholoyl-CoA (3alpha,7alpha-dihydroxy-5beta-cholan-24-one-CoA) and propionyl CoA" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">3alpha,7alpha-dihydroxy-5beta-cholan-24-one-CoA and CoASH react to form chenodeoxycholoyl-CoA (3alpha,7alpha-dihydroxy-5beta-cholan-24-one-CoA) and propionyl CoA. This reaction, in the peroxisomal matrix, is catalyzed by peroxisomal thiolase 2 (sterol carrier protein 2).</p>
        </notes>
