      <reaction compartment="compartment_5460" fast="false" id="reaction_77342" metaid="metaid_1927" name="(S)-Hydroxydecanoyl-CoA+NAD =&gt; 3-Oxodecanoyl-CoA+NADH+H" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">HADH in the mitochondrial matrix dehydrogenates (S)-3-hydroxydecanoyl-CoA to form 3-oxodecanoyl-CoA (Vredendaal et al. 1996).</p>
        </notes>
