      <reaction compartment="compartment_70101" fast="false" id="reaction_193753" metaid="metaid_1930" name="3,7,24THCA-CoA is translocated from the cytosol to the peroxisome" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">3,7,24THCA-CoA is transported from the cytosol into the peroxisome in an ATP-dependent process (Une et al. 2003) mediated by ABCD3 dimer in the peroxisomal membrane (Ferdinandusse et al. 2015; Hillebrand et al. 2007; Russell 2003).</p>
        </notes>
