      <reaction compartment="compartment_5460" fast="false" id="reaction_77325" metaid="metaid_1931" name="trans-Hex-2-enoyl-CoA+H2O&lt;=&gt;(S)-Hydroxyhexanoyl-CoA" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">ECHS1 in the mitochondrial matrix hydrates trans-hex-2-enoyl-CoA to form (S)-3-hydroxyhexanoyl-CoA (Stern and Del Campillo 1956).</p>
        </notes>
