      <reaction compartment="compartment_7660" fast="false" id="reaction_2426163" metaid="metaid_1932" name="SREBP1A,2 binds the CYP51A1 promoter" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">SREBP1A (SREBF1A) or SREBP2, together with NF-Y and SP1, bind and transactivate the promoter of the CYP51A1 gene (Pai et al. 1998, Reed et al. 2008, Rome et al. 2008). SREBP1A and SREBP2 activate CYP51A1 equally (Pai et al. 1998).</p>
        </notes>
        <annotation>
          <rdf:RDF xmlns:rdf="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/" xmlns:vCard="http://www.w3.org/2001/vcard-rdf/3.0#" xmlns:dcterms="http://purl.org/dc/terms/" xmlns:bqbiol="http://biomodels.net/biology-qualifiers/">
