      <reaction compartment="compartment_70101" fast="false" id="reaction_2161651" metaid="metaid_1938" name="PGE2 is converted to PGF2a by CBR1" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Carbonyl reductase (CBR1) aka prostaglandin 9-keto reductase inactivates prostaglandin E2 (PGE2) by converting it to prostaglandin F2alpha (PGF2a) (Wermuth 1981, Miura et al. 2008).</p>
        </notes>
