      <reaction compartment="compartment_17951" fast="false" id="reaction_389897" metaid="metaid_1941" name="Isomerization of (2R)-pristanoyl-CoA to (2S)-pristanoyl-CoA" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Peroxisomal 2-methylacyl-CoA racemase (AMACR) catalyzes the isomerization of (2R)-pristanoyl-CoA to form (2S)-pristanoyl-CoA. The active form of the enzyme is a monomer (Schmitz et al. 1995; Amery et al. 2000; Ferdinandusse et al. 2000).</p>
        </notes>
