      <reaction compartment="compartment_70101" fast="false" id="reaction_6809238" metaid="metaid_1943" name="MTMR7 binds MTMR9" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">MTMR7 binds to MTMR9, an enzymatically inactive myotubularin family member, which results in increased enzymatic activity of MTMR7. Almost all MTMR7 in the cell is present in the complex with MTMR9 (Mochizuki and Majerus 2003).</p>
        </notes>
        <annotation>
          <rdf:RDF xmlns:rdf="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/" xmlns:vCard="http://www.w3.org/2001/vcard-rdf/3.0#" xmlns:dcterms="http://purl.org/dc/terms/" xmlns:bqbiol="http://biomodels.net/biology-qualifiers/">
