      <reaction compartment="compartment_12045" fast="false" id="reaction_1482626" metaid="metaid_1955" name="2-acyl LPI is acylated to PI by MBOAT7" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">At the endoplasmic reticulum (ER) membrane, lysophospholipid acyltransferase 7 (MBOAT7) aka LPIAT acylates 2-acyl lysophosphatidylinositol (LPI) to form phosphatidylinositol (PI) (Gijon et al. 2008, Lee et al. 2008).</p>
        </notes>
