      <reaction compartment="compartment_70101" fast="false" id="reaction_9024881" metaid="metaid_1958" name="ALOX15 dehydrogenates 17(S)-Hp-DHA to 16S,17S-epoxy-DHA" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Instead of undergoing a second oxygenation (to form PDX), the hydroperoxide intermediate 17(S)-Hp-DHA undergoes a hydrogen abstraction by 15-lipoxygenase (ALOX15) to form an intermediate epoxide, 16S,17S-epoxy-DHA (Hong et al. 2003, Serhan et al. 2006, Hong et al. 2007, Aursnes et al. 2015). This epoxide has now proved to be the precursor for the production of (neuro)protectin D1 ((N)PD1) as well as production of protectin conjugates in tissue regeneration (PCTRs) (Dalli et al. 2015, Ramon et al. 2016, Aursnes et al. 2015).</p>
        </notes>
        <annotation>
          <rdf:RDF xmlns:rdf="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/" xmlns:vCard="http://www.w3.org/2001/vcard-rdf/3.0#" xmlns:dcterms="http://purl.org/dc/terms/" xmlns:bqbiol="http://biomodels.net/biology-qualifiers/">
