      <reaction compartment="compartment_876" fast="false" id="reaction_1675834" metaid="metaid_1959" name="PI(3,4)P2 is transported from the plasma membrane to the early endosome membrane" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">In mice, phosphatidylinositol 3,4-bisphosphate (PI(3,4)P2) translocates from the plasma membrane to the early endosome membrane (Watt et al. 2004). A similar event has also been detected in cells from Chlorocebus sabaeus (Green Monkey) (Ivetac et al. 2005). In humans this event is inferred from the other two occurrences.</p>
        </notes>
        <annotation>
          <rdf:RDF xmlns:rdf="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/" xmlns:vCard="http://www.w3.org/2001/vcard-rdf/3.0#" xmlns:dcterms="http://purl.org/dc/terms/" xmlns:bqbiol="http://biomodels.net/biology-qualifiers/">
