      <reaction compartment="compartment_12045" fast="false" id="reaction_1483229" metaid="metaid_1960" name="PI:PITPNB is transported from the ER membrane to the Golgi membrane" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">The phosphatidylinositol transfer protein beta isoform (PITPNB) bound to phosphatidylinositol (PI) complex transports from the endoplasmic reticulum (ER) membrane to the Golgi membrane (Carvou et al. 2010, Yoder et al. 2001, Shadan et al. 2008).</p>
        </notes>
        <annotation>
          <rdf:RDF xmlns:rdf="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/" xmlns:vCard="http://www.w3.org/2001/vcard-rdf/3.0#" xmlns:dcterms="http://purl.org/dc/terms/" xmlns:bqbiol="http://biomodels.net/biology-qualifiers/">
