      <reaction compartment="compartment_17951" fast="false" id="reaction_8848586" metaid="metaid_1968" name="Transport of cytosolic HXOL to the peroxisome" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">The existence of a mechanism to transport HXOL (hexadecanol) between the cytosol and the peroxisomal matrix is inferred from studies of wax synthesis in cultured cells (Cheng and Russell 2004). A transporter for HXOL has not been identified.</p>
        </notes>
