      <reaction compartment="compartment_17951" fast="false" id="reaction_389632" metaid="metaid_1969" name="pristanate + CoA-SH + ATP =&gt; pristanoyl-CoA + AMP + pyrophosphate" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">VLCS (very long chain acyl-CoA synthetase), associated with the inner surface of the peroxisomal membrane, catalyzes the reaction of pristanate, CoA-SH and ATP to form pristanoyl-CoA, AMP and pyrophosphate (Steinberg et al. 1999).</p>
        </notes>
