      <reaction compartment="compartment_70101" fast="false" id="reaction_9020262" metaid="metaid_1978" name="ALOX15 dehydrogenates 17(R)-Hp-DHA to 17R(16)-epoxy-DHA" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">The hydroperoxide intermediate of docosahexaenoic acid (17(R)-Hp-DHA) undergoes a second hydrogen abstraction by 15-lipoxygenase (ALOX15) to form the intermediate epoxide 17R(16)-epoxy-DHA (Serhan et al. 2011).</p>
        </notes>
