      <reaction compartment="compartment_5460" fast="false" id="reaction_77312" metaid="metaid_1984" name="(S)-Hydroxybutanoyl-CoA+NAD =&gt; Acetoacetyl-CoA+NADH+H" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">HADH in the mitochondrial matrix dehydrogenates (S)-3-hydroxybutanoyl-CoA to form acetoacetyl-CoA (Vredendaal et al. 1996; Barycki et al. 1999).</p>
        </notes>
