      <reaction compartment="compartment_876" fast="false" id="reaction_1675780" metaid="metaid_1987" name="PI is phosphorylated to PI4P by PI4K2A/B at the plasma membrane" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">At the plasma membrane, phosphatidylinositol 4-kinase type 2-alpha (PI4K2A) (Balla et al. 2002, Minogue et al. 2001) and beta (PI4K2B) (Balla et al. 2002, Wei et al. 2002) phosphorylate phosphatidylinositol (PI) to phosphatidylinositol 4-phosphate (PI4P).</p>
        </notes>
