      <reaction compartment="compartment_876" fast="false" id="reaction_6809975" metaid="metaid_1988" name="PI3P is dephosphorylated to PI by the MTMR2:SBF2 tetramer at the plasma membrane" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Formation of the complex with SBF2 (MTMR13) dramatically increases phosphatidylinositol-3-phosphatase catalytic activity of MTMR2. Since SBF2 sequesters MTRM2 from endosome membranes, the MTMR2 presumably acts on the plasma membrane-associated substrate (Berger et al. 2006).</p>
        </notes>
        <annotation>
