      <reaction compartment="compartment_70101" fast="false" id="reaction_2161659" metaid="metaid_1990" name="PGE2 is dehydrated to PGA2" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Cyclopentenone prostaglandins comprise a family of molecules that are formed by dehydration of hydroxyl moieties in prostaglandin E2 (PGE2) and prostaglandin D2 (PGD2). Dehydration of PGE2 leads to prostaglandin A2 (PGA2) (Hamberg and Samuelsson B 1966, Amin 1989).</p>
        </notes>
        <annotation>
          <rdf:RDF xmlns:rdf="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/" xmlns:vCard="http://www.w3.org/2001/vcard-rdf/3.0#" xmlns:dcterms="http://purl.org/dc/terms/" xmlns:bqmodel="http://biomodels.net/model-qualifiers/" xmlns:bqbiol="http://biomodels.net/biology-qualifiers/">
