      <reaction compartment="compartment_70101" fast="false" id="reaction_75887" metaid="metaid_1993" name="Conversion of Glycerol to Glycerol-3-phosphate" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Glycerol can be a source for glycerol-3-phosphate, in which case, a phosphate form ATP is transferred to glycerol by glycerol kinase forming glycerol-3-phosphate and ADP.</p>
        </notes>
