      <reaction compartment="compartment_12045" fast="false" id="reaction_6807064" metaid="metaid_1997" name="DHCR24 reduces ZYMOL to ZYMSTNL" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">DHCR24 (delta(24)-sterol reductase) associated with the endoplasmic reticulum membranecatalyzes the reduction of ZYMOL (zymosterol) to ZYMSTNL (zymostenol) (Kandutsch and Russell 1960; Mitsche et al. 2015; Waterham et al. 2001).</p>
        </notes>
