      <reaction compartment="compartment_70101" fast="false" id="reaction_193060" metaid="metaid_2002" name="CYP19A1 hydroxylates ANDST to E1" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">The conversion of androstenedione (ANDST) to estrone (E1) is catalysed by aromatase (CYP19A1) associated with the endoplasmic reticulum membrane (Toda et al. 1990, Simpson et al. 1994).</p>
        </notes>
