      <reaction compartment="compartment_70101" fast="false" id="reaction_2161945" metaid="metaid_2005" name="EXC4 is converted to EXD4 by GGT" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">In an analogous reaction to the formation of leukotriene D4 (LTD4), eoxin C4 (EXC4) is converted to eoxin D4 (EXD4) by a class of gamma-glutamyltransferase (GGT) (Feltenmark et al. 2008, Claesson et al. 2008) which has not yet been identified.</p>
        </notes>
        <annotation>
          <rdf:RDF xmlns:rdf="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/" xmlns:vCard="http://www.w3.org/2001/vcard-rdf/3.0#" xmlns:dcterms="http://purl.org/dc/terms/" xmlns:bqbiol="http://biomodels.net/biology-qualifiers/">
