      <reaction compartment="compartment_17927" fast="false" id="reaction_200424" metaid="metaid_2007" name="Exchange of acylcarnitine and carnitine across the inner mitochondrial membrane" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">The carnitine-acylcarnitine transporter (SLC25A20 / CACT), embedded in the inner mitochondrial membrane, mediates the exchange of palmitoyl-carnitine (and other acylcarnitine esters) and carnitine across the inner mitochondrial membrane (Huizing et al., 1997).</p>
        </notes>
