      <reaction compartment="compartment_5460" fast="false" id="reaction_77254" metaid="metaid_2027" name="(S)-3-Hydroxydodecanoyl-CoA+NAD =&gt; 3-Oxododecanoyl-CoA+NADH+H" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">HADH in the mitochondrial matrix dehydrogenates (S)-3-hydroxylauroyl-CoA to form 3-oxolauroyl-CoA (Vredendaal et al. 1996).</p>
        </notes>
