      <reaction compartment="compartment_70101" fast="false" id="reaction_2161614" metaid="metaid_2032" name="PGD2 is reduced to 11-epi-PGF2a by AKRIC3" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Aldo-keto reductase family 1 member C3 (AKR1C3) aka PGFS is the enzyme involved in NADPH-dependent prostaglandin D2 11-keto reductase activity of reducing prostaglandin D2 (PGD2) to 11-epi-Prostaglandin F2alpha (11-epi-PGF2a) (Liston and Roberts 1985, Koda et al. 2004, Byrns et al. 2010).</p>
        </notes>
        <annotation>
          <rdf:RDF xmlns:rdf="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/" xmlns:vCard="http://www.w3.org/2001/vcard-rdf/3.0#" xmlns:dcterms="http://purl.org/dc/terms/" xmlns:bqmodel="http://biomodels.net/model-qualifiers/" xmlns:bqbiol="http://biomodels.net/biology-qualifiers/">
