      <reaction compartment="compartment_5460" fast="false" id="reaction_77274" metaid="metaid_2034" name="myristoyl-CoA+FAD =&gt; trans-tetradec-2-enoyl-CoA+FADH2" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">ACADL in the mitochondrial matrix dehydrogenates palmitoyl-CoA to form trans-tetradec-2-enoyl-CoA. (Krane and Beinert 1956; Kelley 1992).</p>
