      <reaction compartment="compartment_171062" fast="false" id="reaction_1676041" metaid="metaid_2035" name="Presence of PI(3,5)P2 stimulates the maturation of the early endosome into the late endosome" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">The presence of phosphatidylinositol 3,5-bisphosphate (PI(3,5)P2) in the early endosome membrane stimulates the vesicle maturation into the late endosome (Cabezas et al. 2006, Ikonomov et al. 2006, Ikonomov et al. 2001).</p>
        </notes>
        <annotation>
