      <reaction compartment="compartment_17951" fast="false" id="reaction_193452" metaid="metaid_2041" name="Isomerization of 25(R) DHCA-CoA to 25(S) DHCA-CoA" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">The isomerization of 25(R) DHCA-CoA to 25(S) DHCA-CoA, catalyzed by 2-methylacyl-CoA racemase, occurs in the peroxisomal matrix.</p>
