      <reaction compartment="compartment_12045" fast="false" id="reaction_9945787" metaid="metaid_2044" name="NSDHL decarboxylates 4a-carboxy-5a-cholest-8-ene-3b-ol to 5a-cholest-8-en-3-one" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">NSDHL (Sterol-4-alpha-carboxylate 3-dehydrogenase, decarboxylating), in the endoplasmic reticulum membrane, decarboxylates 4alpha-carboxy-5alpha-cholest-8-ene-3beta-ol to 5alpha-cholest-8-en-3-one (Liu et al. 1999).</p>
        </notes>
        <annotation>
