      <reaction compartment="compartment_17957" fast="false" id="reaction_2046097" metaid="metaid_2053" name="Desaturation of tetracosatetraenoyl-CoA to tetracosapentaenoyl-CoA" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Tetracosatetraenoyl-CoA is further desaturated by delta 6-desaturase (FADS2) to tetracosapentaenoyl-CoA (TPA-CoA, 6,9,12,15,18-24:5(n-6)).</p>
        </notes>
