      <reaction compartment="compartment_12045" fast="false" id="reaction_2317530" metaid="metaid_2057" name="SREBP1A,1C,2 binds SCAP:cholesterol:INSIG and is retained in the endoplasmic reticulum" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">SREBPs (SREBP1A/1C/2, SREBFs) bind SCAP in the endoplasmic reticulum membrane. Luminal loop 1 of SCAP binds cholesterol which prevents SCAP from interacting with Sec24 in the CopII coat complex and allows SCAP to interact with INSIG instead. These interactions retain SCAP:SREBP1A/1C/2 in the endoplasmic reticulum. The order of assembly of the SREBP1A/1C/2:SCAP:cholesterol:INSIG complex is unknown.</p>
        </notes>
        <annotation>
          <rdf:RDF xmlns:rdf="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/" xmlns:vCard="http://www.w3.org/2001/vcard-rdf/3.0#" xmlns:dcterms="http://purl.org/dc/terms/" xmlns:bqbiol="http://biomodels.net/biology-qualifiers/">
