      <reaction compartment="compartment_17957" fast="false" id="reaction_2161588" metaid="metaid_2062" name="Delta12-PGJ2 is dehydrated to 15d-PGJ2" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">15-Deoxy-delta(12,14)-PDJ2 (15d-PGJ2) is a dehydration product of delta-12-prostaglandin J2 (delta12-PGJ2) (Monneret et al. 2002).</p>
