      <reaction compartment="compartment_5460" fast="false" id="reaction_109341" metaid="metaid_2072" name="dehydrogenation of 4-cis-decenoyl-CoA to form 2-trans-4-cis-decadienoyl-CoA" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">4-cis-decenoyl-CoA transits through the first step of the saturated beta-oxidation spiral to yield 2-trans-4-cis-decadienoyl-CoA.</p>
        </notes>
        <annotation>
