      <reaction compartment="compartment_70101" fast="false" id="reaction_6809309" metaid="metaid_2083" name="MTMR6 binds MTMR9" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">MTMR6 binds to MTMR9, an enzymatically inactive myotubularin family member, which leads to increased catalytic activity of MTMR6 (Zou et al. 2009).</p>
        </notes>
