      <reaction compartment="compartment_70101" fast="false" id="reaction_549192" metaid="metaid_2092" name="1,2-diacyl-glycerol + acyl-CoA =&gt; triacylglycerol + CoASH [DGAT2]" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Diacylglycerol O-acyltransferase 1 (DGAT2) associated with the endoplasmic reticulum membrane catalyzes the reaction of 1,2-diacyl-glycerol and acyl-CoA to form triacylglycerol + CoASH (Cases et al. 2001, Wakimoto et al. 2003).</p>
        </notes>
        <annotation>
          <rdf:RDF xmlns:rdf="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/" xmlns:vCard="http://www.w3.org/2001/vcard-rdf/3.0#" xmlns:dcterms="http://purl.org/dc/terms/" xmlns:bqbiol="http://biomodels.net/biology-qualifiers/">
