      <reaction compartment="compartment_70101" fast="false" id="reaction_2161959" metaid="metaid_2106" name="12R-HpETE is reduced to 12R-HETE by GPX1/2/4" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Glutathione peroxidase 1 (GPX1) (Bryant et al. 1982, Sutherland et al. 2001), 2 (GPX2) (Chu et al. 1993), and 4 (Bryant et al. 1982, Sutherland et al. 2001) are involved in converting 12R-hydroperoxy-eicosatetraenoic acid (12R-HpETE) to 12R-hydro-eicosatetraenoic acid (12R-HETE).</p>
        </notes>
        <annotation>
