      <reaction compartment="compartment_5460" fast="false" id="reaction_73918" metaid="metaid_2108" name="acetoacetyl-CoA+acetyl-CoA =&gt; HMG-CoA + CoASH" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Hydroxymethylglutaryl-CoA synthase tetramer (HMGCS2) in the mitochondrial matrix catalyzes the reaction of acetoacetyl-CoA and acetyl-CoA to form beta-hydroxy-beta-methylglutaryl coenzyme A (HMG CoA) and CoA (Aledo et al. 2001).</p>
        </notes>
        <annotation>
