      <reaction compartment="compartment_171062" fast="false" id="reaction_6809720" metaid="metaid_2116" name="PI3P is dephosphorylated to PI by MTM1:MTMR12" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Binding of MTMR12 to MTM1 enhances phosphatidylinositol-3-phosphatase activity of MTM1 at cytosolic vesicular structures, presumably early or late endosomes (Caldwell et al. 1991, Nandurkar et al. 2003, Gupta et al. 2013).</p>
        </notes>
