      <reaction compartment="compartment_70101" fast="false" id="reaction_2161844" metaid="metaid_2118" name="15k-LXA4 is reduced to dhk-LXA4 by PTGR1" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Prostaglandin reductase 1 (PTGR1) aka LTB4DH, a 15-oxoprostaglandin 13-reductase (Yokomizo et al. 1996), metabolises 15-oxo lipoxin A4 aka 15-keto-LXA4 (15k-LXA4) to produce 13,14-dihydro-15-keto-Lipoxin A4 (dhk-LXA4). This reaction has been inferred from a reaction in pig (Clish et al. 2000).</p>
        </notes>
