          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Trifunctional protein in the mitochondrial matrix dehydrogenates (S)-3-hydroxytetradecanoyl-CoA to form 3-oxotetradecanoyl-CoA (Carpenter et al. 1992).</p>
