      <reaction compartment="compartment_12045" fast="false" id="reaction_9915992" metaid="metaid_2123" name="Arachidonate is hydroxylated to 17-HETE by CYP(1)" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Cytochrome P450s 1A1 (CYP1A1), 1A2 (CYP1A2), and 1B1 (CYP1B1) convert arachidonate to 17-hydroxyeicosatetraenoate (17-HETE) (Choudhary et al. 2004).</p>
        </notes>
