      <reaction compartment="compartment_74700" fast="false" id="reaction_9840581" metaid="metaid_2125" name="GM1 localizes to endosome membrane" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Ganglioside GM1, the intermediate produced by cleaving sialic acid from higher gangliosides in the plasma membrane, is internalized by endocytosis (reviewed by Sandhoff and Sandhoff, 2018).</p>
        </notes>
