      <reaction compartment="compartment_70101" fast="false" id="reaction_194025" metaid="metaid_2127" name="11-deoxycortisol translocates to the mitochondrion" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">11-deoxycortisol is synthesized in a reaction at the endoplasmic reticulum membrane and is further metabolized to cortisol in a reaction catalyzed by mitochondrial enzymes. The means by which 11-deoxycortisol translocates into the mitochondrial matrix, however, is unknown.</p>
        </notes>
        <annotation>
