      <reaction compartment="compartment_70101" fast="false" id="reaction_9032323" metaid="metaid_2135" name="oxo-DPAn-3s translocate from cytosol to extracellular region" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">To produce their pro-resolving effects, oxo-DPAn-3s (7-, 13- and 17-oxo-DPAn-3) are released into the exudate of local inflammation sites (Cipollina 2015). The mechanism of translocation is unknown.</p>
        </notes>
