      <reaction compartment="compartment_70101" fast="false" id="reaction_191380" metaid="metaid_2141" name="Mevalonate is phosphorylated to mevalonate-5-phosphate" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Cytosolic mevalonate kinase (MK) catalyzes the phosphorylation of mevalonate (MVA) to mevalonate-5-phosphate (MVA5P) (Hogenboom et al. 2004; Houten and Waterham 2000: Schafer et al. 1992).</p>
        </notes>
