      <reaction compartment="compartment_70616" fast="false" id="reaction_200410" metaid="metaid_2142" name="CPT2 converts acylcarnitine to acyl-CoA" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">CPT2, associated with the inner mitochondrial membrane, catalyzes the reaction of C8-C18 acylcarnitines and CoASH to form acyl-CoA and carnitine (Verderio et al. 1995; Violante et al. 2010).</p>
        </notes>
