      <reaction compartment="compartment_70101" fast="false" id="reaction_2161964" metaid="metaid_2145" name="Arachidonate is oxidised to 12S-HpETE by ALOX12/15" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Arachidonate 12-lipoxygenase, 12S-type (ALOX12) (Funk et al. 1990, Izumi et al. 1990) and arachidonate 15-lipoxygenase (ALOX15) (Kuhn et al. 1993, Sigal et al. 1990) convert arachidonate into 12S-hydroperoxy-eicosatetraenoic acid (12S-HpETE).</p>
        </notes>
