      <reaction compartment="compartment_70101" fast="false" id="reaction_5693390" metaid="metaid_2160" name="HSD17B11 dehydrogenates EST17b to E1" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Estradiol 17-beta-dehydrogenase 11 (HSD17B11) may participate in androgen metabolism during steroidogenesis where it dehydrogenates estradiol-17-beta (EST17b) to estrone (E1) (Chai et al. 2003).</p>
        </notes>
