      <reaction compartment="compartment_70616" fast="false" id="reaction_1482773" metaid="metaid_2173" name="MLCL transports from the IM to the ER" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Monolysocardiolipin (MLCL) transports via membrane contact sites between the endoplasmic reticulum (ER) and the inner mitochondria membranes (IM) (Cao et al. 2004, Zhao et al. 2009, Taylor and Hatch 2009).</p>
        </notes>
