      <reaction compartment="compartment_171062" fast="false" id="reaction_1675974" metaid="metaid_2174" name="PI is phosphorylated to PI4P by PI4K2A/B at the early endosome membrane" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">At the early endosome membrane, phosphatidylinositol 4-kinase type 2-alpha/beta (PI4K2A/B) (Balla et al. 2002) phosphorylates phosphatidylinositol (PI) to produce phosphatidylinositol 4-phosphate (PI4P).</p>
        </notes>
