      <reaction compartment="compartment_5460" fast="false" id="reaction_77277" metaid="metaid_2175" name="trans-Tetradec-2-enoyl-CoA+H2O =&gt; (S)-3-Hydroxytetradecanoyl-CoA" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Trifunctional protein in the mitochondrial matrix hydrates trans-tetradec-2-enoyl-CoA to form (S)-3-hydroxytetradecanoyl-CoA (Carpenter et al. 1992).</p>
        </notes>
