      <reaction compartment="compartment_20699" fast="false" id="reaction_1483211" metaid="metaid_2188" name="PC:PITPNB is transported from the Golgi membrane to the ER membrane" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">The complex between phosphatidylcholine (PC) and phosphatidylinositol transfer protein beta isoform (PITPNB) transports from the Golgi membrane to the ER membrane (Carvou et al. 2010, Yoder et al. 2001, Shadan et al. 2008).</p>
        </notes>
