      <reaction compartment="compartment_17957" fast="false" id="reaction_2299725" metaid="metaid_2192" name="PGH2 diffuses from the endoplasmic reticulum lumen to the cytosol" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">PGH2 moves from the endoplasmic reticulum to the cytosol. The mechanism of this movement has not been determined and could could simply be diffusion through the ER membrane. No transporter localized to intracellular membranes with specificity for PGH2 has been identified.</p>
        </notes>
        <annotation>
