      <reaction compartment="compartment_12045" fast="false" id="reaction_1482867" metaid="metaid_2196" name="DLCL is acylated to MLCL by LCLAT1 (ER)" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">At the endoplasmic reticulum (ER) membrane, lysocardiolipin acyltransferase 1 (LCLAT1) aka ALCAT1 acylates dilysocardiolipin (DLCL) to produce monolysocardiolipin (MLCL) (Zhao et al. 2009).</p>
        </notes>
        <annotation>
          <rdf:RDF xmlns:rdf="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/" xmlns:vCard="http://www.w3.org/2001/vcard-rdf/3.0#" xmlns:dcterms="http://purl.org/dc/terms/" xmlns:bqbiol="http://biomodels.net/biology-qualifiers/">
            <rdf:Description rdf:about="#metaid_2196">
              <dc:creator>
