      <reaction compartment="compartment_70616" fast="false" id="reaction_1482689" metaid="metaid_2197" name="1-acyl LPG is acylated to PG by CRLS1 (IM)" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">At the inner mitochondrial (IR) membrane, cardiolipin synthase (CRLS1) acylates 1-acyl lysophosphatidylglycerol (LPG) to form phosphatidylglycerol (PG) (Nie et al. 2010).</p>
        </notes>
        <annotation>
          <rdf:RDF xmlns:rdf="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/" xmlns:vCard="http://www.w3.org/2001/vcard-rdf/3.0#" xmlns:dcterms="http://purl.org/dc/terms/" xmlns:bqbiol="http://biomodels.net/biology-qualifiers/">
