      <reaction compartment="compartment_5460" fast="false" id="reaction_74180" metaid="metaid_2199" name="HMG CoA =&gt; acetoacetic acid + acetyl CoA" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Hydroxymethylglutaryl-CoA lyase dimer (HMGCL) in the mitochondrial matrix catalyzes the reaction of beta-hydroxy-beta-methylglutaryl coenzyme A (HMG CoA) to form acetyl-CoA and acetoacetate (Mitchell et al. 1993).</p>
        </notes>
