      <reaction compartment="compartment_876" fast="false" id="reaction_1640164" metaid="metaid_2210" name="ENPP7 hydrolyzes sphingomyelin" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Membrane-bound ectonucleotide pyrophosphatase/phosphodiesterase 7 (ENPP7) mediates the hydrolysis of sphingomyelin to ceramide and choline phosphate (Duan et al. 2003, Wu et al. 2005).</p>
        </notes>
