      <reaction compartment="compartment_17957" fast="false" id="reaction_2161732" metaid="metaid_2218" name="TXB2 is converted to 11dh-TXB2 by TXDH" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Thromboxane B2 (TXB2) undergoes dehydrogenation at C-11 to form 11-dehydro-thromboxane B2 (11dh-TXB2). The enzyme responsible for catalysis has been termed 11-dehydroxythromboxane B2 dehydrogenase (TXDH) (Kumlin and Granström 1986, Catella et al. 1986, Westlund et al. 1994). The human TXDH isoform has not been cloned but 11dh-TXB2 has been detected in various experiments.</p>
        </notes>
