      <reaction compartment="compartment_70101" fast="false" id="reaction_191402" metaid="metaid_2220" name="Reduction of presqualene diphosphate to form squalene" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">In the second step of squalene formation from farnesyl diphosphate (FAPP), FDFT (Farnesyl-diphosphate farnesyltransferase) catalyzes the reduction of presqualene diphosphate (PSQPP) to squalene (SQNE) (Pandit et al. 2000).</p>
        </notes>
