      <reaction compartment="compartment_12045" fast="false" id="reaction_9947148" metaid="metaid_2221" name="CYP51A1 14-demethylates 24,25-dhLAN to 4,4-diMeCholesta-8,14-dien-3-ol" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">CYP51A1 (Lanosterol 14-alpha demethylase), inferred to be located in the endoplasmic reticulum membrane (Aoyama et al. 1996), demethylates 24,25-dhLAN (24,25-dihydrolanosterol) to 4,4-diMeCholesta-8,14-dien-3-ol (Sonoda et al. 1993; Stromstedt et al. 1996), in a reaction coupled to POR-mediated reduction of oxidized heme iron atoms.</p>
        </notes>
        <annotation>
