      <reaction compartment="compartment_171062" fast="false" id="reaction_1676206" metaid="metaid_2226" name="PI4P is phosphorylated to PI(3,4)P2 by PIK3C2A at the early endosome membrane" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">At the early endosome membrane, phosphatidylinositol-4-phosphate 3-kinase C2 domain-containing subunit alpha (PIK3C2A) (Kraq et al. 2010, Arcaro et al. 2000) phosphorylates phosphatidylinositol 4-phosphate (PI4P) to phosphatidylinositol 3,4-bisphosphate (PI(3,4)P2).</p>
        </notes>
        <annotation>
