      <reaction compartment="compartment_5460" fast="false" id="reaction_77314" metaid="metaid_2229" name="Crotonoyl-CoA+H2O =&gt; (S)-3-Hydroxybutanoyl-CoA" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">ECHS1 in the mitochondrial matrix hydrates (2E)-butenoyl-CoA (crotonoyl-CoA) to form (S)-3-hydroxybutanoyl-CoA (Stern and Del Campillo 1956).</p>
        </notes>
        <annotation>
