      <reaction compartment="compartment_20699" fast="false" id="reaction_9845516" metaid="metaid_2230" name="B3GALT4 transfers Gal to gangliosides" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Beta-1,3-galactosyltransferase 4 (B3GALT4) transfers galactose (Gal) from UDP-alpha-D-galactose (UDP-Gal) to the β1,3 position of the beta-N-acetylglucosamine (β-GlcNAc) residue on gangliosides GM2/GD2/GA2 to form gangliosides GM1/GD1b/GA1 (Amado et al., 1998; reviewed in Hennet, 2002).</p>
        </notes>
        <annotation>
          <rdf:RDF xmlns:rdf="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/" xmlns:vCard="http://www.w3.org/2001/vcard-rdf/3.0#" xmlns:dcterms="http://purl.org/dc/terms/" xmlns:bqbiol="http://biomodels.net/biology-qualifiers/">
