      <reaction compartment="compartment_876" fast="false" id="reaction_266070" metaid="metaid_2243" name="LTC4 is exported from the cytosol by ABCC1" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">On formation, leukotriene C4 (LTC4) is exported to the extracellular region by the ABCC1 transporter (Sjolinder et al. 1999, Leier et al. 1994, Lam et al. 1989) and processed further by cleavage reactions.</p>
        </notes>
        <annotation>
          <rdf:RDF xmlns:rdf="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/" xmlns:vCard="http://www.w3.org/2001/vcard-rdf/3.0#" xmlns:dcterms="http://purl.org/dc/terms/" xmlns:bqmodel="http://biomodels.net/model-qualifiers/" xmlns:bqbiol="http://biomodels.net/biology-qualifiers/">
