      <reaction compartment="compartment_5460" fast="false" id="reaction_109342" metaid="metaid_2244" name="Trans,cis-lauro-2,6-dienoyl-CoA is converted to cis,cis-3,6- 4-cis-decenoyl-CoA by one cycle of beta-oxidation" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">One cycle of beta oxidation, each mediated by the activities of trifunctional protein and ACADL tetramer, converts trans,cis-lauro-2,6-dienoyl-CoA to 4-cis-decenoyl-CoA plus molecules of CoA-SH, FADH2, and NADH + H+.</p>
        </notes>
        <annotation>
          <rdf:RDF xmlns:rdf="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/" xmlns:vCard="http://www.w3.org/2001/vcard-rdf/3.0#" xmlns:dcterms="http://purl.org/dc/terms/" xmlns:bqbiol="http://biomodels.net/biology-qualifiers/">
