      <reaction compartment="compartment_70101" fast="false" id="reaction_9915968" metaid="metaid_2246" name="8,9-EET is hydrolysed to 8.9-DHET by EPHX2" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Epoxide hydrolase 2 (EPHX2) hydrolyses 8,9-epoxyeicosatrienoate (5,6-EET) to 8,9-dihydroxyeicosatrienoate(5,6-DHET) (Werner et al. 2002; Gomez et al. 2004). The majority of the EET biological activities are diminished by this hydrolysis.</p>
        </notes>
        <annotation>
