      <reaction compartment="compartment_70101" fast="false" id="reaction_191303" metaid="metaid_2248" name="FDPS dimer transfers IPPP to GPP" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Further condensation of an isopentenyl pyrophosphate (IPPP) with geranyl pyrophosphate (GPP) to form farnesyl pyrophosphate (FAPP) is catalyzed by the prenyltransferases FPP synthase and GGPP synthase (Ericsson et al. 1998; Kavanagh et al, 2006; Kuzuguchi et al. 1999).</p>
        </notes>
        <annotation>
          <rdf:RDF xmlns:rdf="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/" xmlns:vCard="http://www.w3.org/2001/vcard-rdf/3.0#" xmlns:dcterms="http://purl.org/dc/terms/" xmlns:bqmodel="http://biomodels.net/model-qualifiers/" xmlns:bqbiol="http://biomodels.net/biology-qualifiers/">
