      <reaction compartment="compartment_5460" fast="false" id="reaction_77321" metaid="metaid_2251" name="3-Oxohexanoyl-CoA+CoA-SH =&gt; Butanoyl-CoA + acetyl-CoA" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Trifunctional protein in the mitochondrial matrix converts 3-oxohexanoyl-CoA to butanoyl-CoA plus acetyl-CoA (Carpenter et al. 1992).</p>
