      <reaction compartment="compartment_5460" fast="false" id="reaction_77323" metaid="metaid_2253" name="(S)-Hydroxyhexanoyl-CoA+NAD =&gt; 3-Oxohexanoyl-CoA+NADH+H" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">HADH in the mitochondrial matrix dehydrogenates (S)-3-hydroxyhexanoyl-CoA to form 3-oxohexanoyl-CoA (Vredendaal et al. 1996).</p>
