      <reaction compartment="compartment_17951" fast="false" id="reaction_390250" metaid="metaid_2256" name="3-ketohexacosanoyl-CoA + CoASH =&gt; tetracosanoyl-CoA + acetyl-CoA" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Peroxisomal ACAA1 catalyzes the reaction of 3-ketohexacosanoyl-CoA and CoASH to form tetracosanoyl-CoA + acetyl-CoA (Bout et al. 1991).</p>
