      <reaction compartment="compartment_70616" fast="false" id="reaction_1482794" metaid="metaid_2257" name="CL and 1-acyl LPC are converted to MLCL and PC by TAZ (IM) (Reversible)" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">At the inner mitochondrial membrane (IM), tafazzin (TAZ) converts cardiolipin (CL) and 1-acyl lysophosphatidylcholine (LPC) to monolysocardiolipin (MLCL) and phosphatidylcholine (PC) (Xu et al. 2003, Xu et al. 2006, Malhotra et al. 2009).</p>
        </notes>
