      <reaction compartment="compartment_20699" fast="false" id="reaction_1483087" metaid="metaid_2261" name="PI is exchanged with PC by PITPNB" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">At the Golgi membrane, phosphatidylinositol (PI) is exchanged for phosphatidylcholine (PC) within the phosphatidylinositol transfer protein beta isoform (PITPNB) complex (Tilley et al. 2004, Yoder et al. 2001, Carvou et al. 2010, Schouten et al. 2002, Vordtriede et al. 2005, Shadan et al. 2008).</p>
        </notes>
        <annotation>
