      <reaction compartment="compartment_70101" fast="false" id="reaction_1605723" metaid="metaid_2269" name="NEU2 cleaves GM3 to form LacCer (cytosol)" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Sialidase-2 (NEU2) hydrolyses Neu5Ac from GM3 in the cytosol (Monti et al. 1999).</p>
        </notes>
