      <reaction compartment="compartment_70101" fast="false" id="reaction_2065550" metaid="metaid_2273" name="SREBP1A,1C,2 binds Importin beta-1" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">SREBP2 dimer (also called SREBF2 dimer) and, by inference SREBP1A,1C dimer, binds Importin beta-1 via the helix-loop-helix leucine zipper domain of SREBP1A,1C,2 (Nagoshi et al. 1999, Di Pardo et al. 2020).</p>
        </notes>
