      <reaction compartment="compartment_5460" fast="false" id="reaction_193719" metaid="metaid_2282" name="5beta-cholestan-3alpha,7alpha,24(S),27-tetrol is oxidized to 3alpha,7alpha,24(S)-trihydroxy-5beta-cholestan-27-al" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">5beta-cholestan-3alpha,7alpha,24(S),27-tetrol, NADPH + H+, and O2 react to form 3alpha,7alpha,24(S)-trihydroxy-5beta-cholestan-27-al, NADP+, and H2O. This oxidation reaction occurs in the mitochondrial matrix, catalyzed by CYP27A1.</p>
        </notes>
