      <reaction compartment="compartment_70101" fast="false" id="reaction_804969" metaid="metaid_2287" name="HSD17B1 hydrogenates E1 to EST17b" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Expression of HSD17B1 which is the main enzyme that catalyzes the hydrogenation of estrone is strongly restricted to placenta, ovaries, endometrium and breast tissue (Moeller and Adamski, 2009).</p>
        </notes>
