      <reaction compartment="compartment_17951" fast="false" id="reaction_390438" metaid="metaid_2288" name="FAR2 reduces PalmCoA to HXOL" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Peroxisomal fatty acyl-CoA reductase 2 (FAR2) catalyzes the reaction of palmitoyl-CoA (PalmCoA) and 2 NADPH + 2 H+ to form hexadecanol (HXOL), CoASH, and 2 NADP+. As judged from mRNA levels, FAR2 is not widely expressed in the body but is abundant in brain (Cheng and Russell 2004).</p>
        </notes>
        <annotation>
