      <reaction compartment="compartment_876" fast="false" id="reaction_1861788" metaid="metaid_2300" name="GBA2 hydrolyzes GlcCer (plasma membrane)" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Human glucosylceramidase 2 (GBA2) hydrolyzes the glucosidic bond of glucocerebrosides (GlcCer) to form ceramide at the plasma membrane (Matern et al. 2001, Boot et al. 2007).</p>
        </notes>
        <annotation>
