      <reaction compartment="compartment_5460" fast="false" id="reaction_193497" metaid="metaid_2305" name="5beta-cholestan-3alpha, 7alpha, 26-triol is oxidized to 3alpha, 7alpha-dihydroxy-5beta-cholestan-26-al" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">5beta-cholestan-3alpha, 7alpha, 26-triol and NADP+ react to form 3alpha, 7alpha-dihydroxy-5beta-cholestan-26-al and NADPH + H+. This oxidation reaction occurs in the mitochondrial matrix, catalyzed by CYP27A1.</p>
        </notes>
        <annotation>
          <rdf:RDF xmlns:rdf="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/" xmlns:vCard="http://www.w3.org/2001/vcard-rdf/3.0#" xmlns:dcterms="http://purl.org/dc/terms/" xmlns:bqbiol="http://biomodels.net/biology-qualifiers/">
            <rdf:Description rdf:about="#metaid_2305">
              <dc:creator>
                <rdf:Bag>
                  <rdf:li rdf:parseType="Resource">
