      <reaction compartment="compartment_70101" fast="false" id="reaction_429016" metaid="metaid_2306" name="ALOX5 is phosphorylated by MAPKAP2" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Arachidonate 5-lipoxygenase (ALOX5) catalyzes the first step in leukotriene biosynthesis and has a key role in inflammatory processes. ALOX5 is phosphorylated by MAPKAPK2; MAPKAPK2 is stimulated by arachidonate.</p>
        </notes>
        <annotation>
          <rdf:RDF xmlns:rdf="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/" xmlns:vCard="http://www.w3.org/2001/vcard-rdf/3.0#" xmlns:dcterms="http://purl.org/dc/terms/" xmlns:bqmodel="http://biomodels.net/model-qualifiers/" xmlns:bqbiol="http://biomodels.net/biology-qualifiers/">
