      <reaction compartment="compartment_12045" fast="false" id="reaction_1483203" metaid="metaid_2308" name="PA is dephosphorylated to DAG by LPIN" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">At the endoplasmic reticulum (ER) membrane, phosphatidate phosphatase 1-3 (LPIN) dephosphorylates phosphatidic acid (PA) to form diacylglycerol (DAG) (Grimsey et al. 2008, Donkor et al. 2007).</p>
        </notes>
