      <reaction compartment="compartment_70101" fast="false" id="reaction_2161666" metaid="metaid_2309" name="PGA2 is isomerised to PGC2" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Dehydration in the cyclopentane ring of prostaglandin E2 (PGE2) yields prostaglandin A2 (PGA2) followed by isomerization of the double bond to yield the unstable compound prostaglandin C2 (PGC2) (Straus and Glass, 2001).</p>
        </notes>
        <annotation>
          <rdf:RDF xmlns:rdf="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/" xmlns:vCard="http://www.w3.org/2001/vcard-rdf/3.0#" xmlns:dcterms="http://purl.org/dc/terms/" xmlns:bqmodel="http://biomodels.net/model-qualifiers/" xmlns:bqbiol="http://biomodels.net/biology-qualifiers/">
