      <reaction compartment="compartment_70101" fast="false" id="reaction_196417" metaid="metaid_2313" name="Reduction of desmosterol to cholesterol" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Desmosterol is reduced by NADPH + H+ to form cholesterol and NADP+, catalyzed by DHCR24 associated with the endoplasmic reticulum membrane.</p>
        </notes>
