      <reaction compartment="compartment_17957" fast="false" id="reaction_2046095" metaid="metaid_2328" name="Elongation of docosatetraenoyl-CoA to tetracosatetraenoyl-CoA" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Docosatetraenoyl-CoA is elongated to tetracosatetraenoyl-CoA (TTA-CoA, 9,12,15,18-tetracosatetraenoic acid, 9,12,15,18-24:4(n-6)) by the elongase enzyme ELOVL2.</p>
