      <reaction compartment="compartment_70101" fast="false" id="reaction_191414" metaid="metaid_2334" name="MVD decarboxylates MVA5PP to IPPP" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Mevalonate pyrophosphate decarboxylase (MPD) decarboxylates mevalonate-5-pyrophosphate (MVA5PP) into isopentenyl pyrophosphate (IPPP) while hydrolysing ATP to ADP and orthophosphate (Toth and Huwyler 1996).</p>
        </notes>
