      <reaction compartment="compartment_876" fast="false" id="reaction_1675810" metaid="metaid_2335" name="PI is phosphorylated to PI5P by PIP5K1A/B at the plasma membrane" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">At the plasma membrane, phosphatidylinositol-4-phosphate 5-kinase type-1 alpha (PIP5K1A) and beta (PIP5K1B) phosphorylate phosphatidylinositol (PI) to produce phosphatidylinositol 5-phosphate (PI5P) (Tolias et al. 1998).</p>
        </notes>
        <annotation>
          <rdf:RDF xmlns:rdf="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/" xmlns:vCard="http://www.w3.org/2001/vcard-rdf/3.0#" xmlns:dcterms="http://purl.org/dc/terms/" xmlns:bqbiol="http://biomodels.net/biology-qualifiers/">
