      <reaction compartment="compartment_5460" fast="false" id="reaction_193054" metaid="metaid_2338" name="Oxidation of cholesterol to 22beta-hydroxycholesterol" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Cholesterol and NADPH + H+ react to form 22beta-hydroxycholesterol, NADP+, and H2O, catalyzed by CYP11A (P450scc) associated with the inner mitochondrial membrane.</p>
        </notes>
