      <reaction compartment="compartment_70101" fast="false" id="reaction_193099" metaid="metaid_2341" name="CYP17A1 cleaves 17aHPROG to ANDST" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">17Alpha-hydroxyprogesterone (17aHPROG), NADPH + H+, and O2 react to form 4-Androstene-3, 17-dione (ANDST), NADP+, H2O, and acetaldehyde. Steroid 17 alpha hydroxylase/17,20 lyase (CYP17A1), which also catalyzes 17-alpha-hydroxylation, catalyzes this lyase reaction.</p>
        </notes>
