      <reaction compartment="compartment_70101" fast="false" id="reaction_6809777" metaid="metaid_2367" name="PI3P is dephosphorylated to PI by MTMR2:SBF1" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Binding to SBF1 (MTMR5) increases phosphatidylinositol-3-phosphatase catalytic activity of MTMR2 (Kim et al. 2003). SBF1 promotes perinuclear localization of MTMR2 (Kim et al. 2003), presumably to the endoplasmic reticulum (ER) membrane, as both proteins can localize to the ER membrane (Berger et al. 2003, Li et al. 2014).</p>
        </notes>
