      <reaction compartment="compartment_17957" fast="false" id="reaction_2161563" metaid="metaid_2372" name="PGJ2 is isomerised to delta12-PGJ2" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Delta-12-prostaglandin J2 (delta12-PGJ2) is an isomerisation product of prostaglandin J2 (PGJ2) (Monneret et al. 2002).</p>
