      <reaction compartment="compartment_17951" fast="false" id="reaction_390276" metaid="metaid_2376" name="Conversion of 4,8,12-trimethyltridecanoyl-CoA to 4,8-dimethylnonanoyl-CoA" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">The beta-oxidation of pristanoyl-CoA requires the conversion of 4,8,12-trimethyltridecanoyl-CoA to 4,8-dimethylnonanoyl-CoA (Verhoeven et al. 1998). This conversion could be mediated by two cycles of beta-oxidation but this specific reaction sequence has not been established experimentally so it is annotated here simply as conversion of 4,8,12-trimethyltridecanoyl-CoA to 4,8-dimethylnonanoyl-CoA with no other reactants and products specified.</p>
        </notes>
        <annotation>
          <rdf:RDF xmlns:rdf="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/" xmlns:vCard="http://www.w3.org/2001/vcard-rdf/3.0#" xmlns:dcterms="http://purl.org/dc/terms/" xmlns:bqbiol="http://biomodels.net/biology-qualifiers/">
