      <reaction compartment="compartment_17957" fast="false" id="reaction_2161673" metaid="metaid_2377" name="PGD2 is dehydrated to 15d-PGD2" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">15-Deoxy-delta 12,14-prostaglandins D2 (15d-PGD2) is a dehydrated form of prostaglandin D2 (PGD2) (Monneret et al. 2002).</p>
        </notes>
