      <reaction compartment="compartment_70101" fast="false" id="reaction_265296" metaid="metaid_2385" name="Arachidonate is oxidised to 5S-HpETE by ALOX5" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Arachidonate 5-lipoxygenase (ALOX5) catalyzes the formation of leukotriene A4 (LTA4) from arachidonate in a two-step process. First, arachidonic acid AA is oxidized to form 5S-hydroperoxyeicosatetranoic acid (5S-HpETE) (Rouzer et al. 1988, Rouzer and Samuelsson 1987, Rouzer et al. 1986).</p>
        </notes>
        <annotation>
