      <reaction compartment="compartment_70101" fast="false" id="reaction_548800" metaid="metaid_2393" name="ELOVL1,2,3,5 elongate AA-CoA and Mal-CoA to 3ODCT-CoA" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Elongation of very long chain fatty acids proteins 1, 2, 3 and 5 (ELOVL1,2,3,5) catalyse the elongation of arachidonyl-CoA (AA-CoA) and malonyl-CoA (Mal-CoA) to form 3-oxo-(7,10,13,16)-docosatetraenoyl-CoA (3ODCT-CoA) (Leonard et al. 2002, Ohno et al. 2010).</p>
        </notes>
        <annotation>
          <rdf:RDF xmlns:rdf="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/" xmlns:vCard="http://www.w3.org/2001/vcard-rdf/3.0#" xmlns:dcterms="http://purl.org/dc/terms/" xmlns:bqbiol="http://biomodels.net/biology-qualifiers/">
