      <reaction compartment="compartment_172574" fast="false" id="reaction_6810392" metaid="metaid_2406" name="TMEM55B translocates to the nucleus" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Under conditions of cellular stress, TMEM55B (type I phosphatidylinositol 4,5-bisphosphate 4-phosphatase) translocates to the nucleus through an unknown mechanism (Zou et al. 2007).</p>
        </notes>
