      <reaction compartment="compartment_17957" fast="false" id="reaction_2046099" metaid="metaid_2410" name="Desaturation of tetracosapentaenoyl-CoA to tetracosahexaenoyl-CoA" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Tetracosapentaenoyl-CoA (9,12,15,18,21-24:5(n-3)) is further converted by delta 6-desaturase (FADS2) to tetracosahexaenoyl-CoA (6,9,12,15,18,21-24:6(n-3)).</p>
        </notes>
