      <reaction compartment="compartment_5460" fast="false" id="reaction_74181" metaid="metaid_2428" name="acetoacetyl-CoA + CoA &lt;=&gt; 2 acetyl-CoA" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Acetyl-CoA acetyltransferase tetramer (ACAT1) in the mitochondrial matrix catalyzes the reversible reaction of acetoacetyl-CoA and CoA to form two molecules of acetyl-CoA (Middleton et al. 1986).</p>
        </notes>
