      <reaction compartment="compartment_70101" fast="false" id="reaction_191983" metaid="metaid_2434" name="Cholesterol is hydroxylated to 25-hydroxycholesterol" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">The microsomal enzyme cholesterol 25-hydroxylase is a member of a lipid metabolizing enzyme family that utilizes oxygen and diiron-oxygen cofactor to hydroxylate, desaturate, epoxidate and acetylate substrates.</p>
        </notes>
        <annotation>
