      <reaction compartment="compartment_70101" fast="false" id="reaction_2161789" metaid="metaid_2435" name="15S-HETE is oxidised to 15-oxoETE by 15-HEDH" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">A 15-hydroxy-eicosatetraenoic acid dehydrogenase (15-HEDH) oxidises 15S-hydroxyeicosatetraenoic acid (15S-HETE) to 15-oxo-eicosatetraenoic acid (15-oxoETE) (Gulliksson et al. 2007). The actual human 15-HEDH has yet to be cloned.</p>
        </notes>
        <annotation>
