      <reaction compartment="compartment_5460" fast="false" id="reaction_77303" metaid="metaid_2438" name="(S)-3-Hydroxyhexadecanoyl-CoA+NAD =&gt; 3-Oxopalmitoyl-CoA+NADH+H" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Trifunctional protein in the mitochondrial matrix dehydrogenates (S)-3-hydroxyhexadecanoyl-CoA to form 3-oxopalmitoyl-CoA (Carpenter et al. 1992).</p>
        </notes>
