      <reaction compartment="compartment_172574" fast="false" id="reaction_1676161" metaid="metaid_2443" name="PI(3,5)P2 transports from the late endosome membrane to the Golgi membrane" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Phosphatidylinositol 3,5-bisphosphate (PI(3,5)P2) translocates from the late endosome membrane to the Golgi membrane (Rutherford et al. 2006).</p>
        </notes>
