      <reaction compartment="compartment_20699" fast="false" id="reaction_1676152" metaid="metaid_2444" name="PI4KB binds to ARF1/3:GTP at the Golgi membrane" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">At the Golgi membrane, ADP-ribosylation factor 1 and 3 (ARF1 and ARF3) complexed to GTP bind to phosphatidylinositol 4-kinase beta (PI4KB) and activate it (Haynes et al. 2007, Wong et al. 1997, Godi et al. 1999).</p>
        </notes>
