      <reaction compartment="compartment_12045" fast="false" id="reaction_5676637" metaid="metaid_2446" name="PTPLs dehydrate VLC3HA-CoA to VLCTDA-CoA" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Very-long-chain (3R)-3-hydroxyacyl-CoA dehydratases 1-4 (PTPLA, B, D1 and D2 respectively, aka HACD1-4) mediate the dehydration step in VLCFA synthesis. A very-long-chain (3R)-3-hydroxyacyl-CoA (VLC3HA-CoA) is dehydrated to a very-long-chain 2,3-trans-enoyl CoA (2,3-TE-CoA) (Ikeda et al. 2008).</p>
        </notes>
        <annotation>
          <rdf:RDF xmlns:rdf="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/" xmlns:vCard="http://www.w3.org/2001/vcard-rdf/3.0#" xmlns:dcterms="http://purl.org/dc/terms/" xmlns:bqbiol="http://biomodels.net/biology-qualifiers/">
