      <reaction compartment="compartment_70101" fast="false" id="reaction_192065" metaid="metaid_2453" name="CYP7B1 7-hydroxylates 25OH-CHOL" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">25-hydroxycholesterol (25OH-CHOL) is 7alpha-hydroxylated to cholest-5-ene-3beta,7alpha,25-triol (CHOL3b,7a,25TRIOL) by CYP7B1 (cytochrome P450 7B1) (Wu et al. 1999).</p>
        </notes>
