      <reaction compartment="compartment_70101" fast="false" id="reaction_266051" metaid="metaid_2456" name="5S-HpETE is dehydrated to LTA4 by ALOX5" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">In the second step of the formation of leukotriene A4 (LTA4) from arachidonate, arachidonate 5-lipoxygenase (ALOX5) converts 5S-hydroperoxyeicosatetranoic acid (5S-HpETE) to an allylic epoxide, leukotriene A4 (LTA4) (Rouzer et al. 1988, Rouzer and Samuelsson 1987, Rouzer et al. 1986).</p>
        </notes>
        <annotation>
          <rdf:RDF xmlns:rdf="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/" xmlns:vCard="http://www.w3.org/2001/vcard-rdf/3.0#" xmlns:dcterms="http://purl.org/dc/terms/" xmlns:bqmodel="http://biomodels.net/model-qualifiers/" xmlns:bqbiol="http://biomodels.net/biology-qualifiers/">
