      <reaction compartment="compartment_17963" fast="false" id="reaction_9846332" metaid="metaid_2464" name="FUT1,2 transfer fucose to gangliosides" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Galactoside 2-α-L-fucosyltransferase 1 and 2 (FUT1,2 aka α-1,2-fucosyltransferase 1,2) transfer a fucose (Fuc) sugar to the galactose (Gal) sugar of gangliosides GA1 and GM1 to form FucGA1 and FucGM1, but also the equivalent derivatives of glycoproteins (H antigen; Larsen et al. 1990; Kelly et al., 1995).</p>
        </notes>
        <annotation>
          <rdf:RDF xmlns:rdf="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/" xmlns:vCard="http://www.w3.org/2001/vcard-rdf/3.0#" xmlns:dcterms="http://purl.org/dc/terms/" xmlns:bqbiol="http://biomodels.net/biology-qualifiers/">
