      <reaction compartment="compartment_12045" fast="false" id="reaction_9945784" metaid="metaid_2466" name="HSD17B7 reduces 4a-methyl-5a-cholest-8-en-3-one to 4a-methyl-5a-cholest-8-en-3b-ol" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">HSD17B7 (3-keto-steroid reductase/17-beta-hydroxysteroid dehydrogenase 7), in the endoplasmic reticulum membrane, reduces 4a-methyl-5a-cholest-8-en-3-one to 4a-methyl-5a-cholest-8-en-3b-ol (Marijanovic et al. 2003).</p>
        </notes>
