      <reaction compartment="compartment_70101" fast="false" id="reaction_9031881" metaid="metaid_2470" name="DPAn-3 resolvins translocate from cytosol to extracellular region" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">To produce their pro-resolving effects, DPAn-3 derived resolvins (RvD1n-3DPA, RvD2n-3DPA and RvD5n-3DPA) are released into the exudate of local inflammation sites (Dalli et al. 2013, Vik et al. 2017). The mechanism of translocation is unknown.</p>
        </notes>
        <annotation>
