      <reaction compartment="compartment_5460" fast="false" id="reaction_71020" metaid="metaid_2482" name="D-methylmalonyl-CoA &lt;=&gt; L-methylmalonyl-CoA" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">At the beginning of this reaction, 1 molecule of 'D-methylmalonyl-CoA' is present. At the end of this reaction, 1 molecule of 'L-methylmalonyl-CoA' is present. This reaction takes place in the 'mitochondrial matrix' and is mediated by the 'methylmalonyl-CoA epimerase activity' of 'methylmalonyl-CoA epimerase'.</p>
        </notes>
