      <reaction compartment="compartment_70101" fast="false" id="reaction_163432" metaid="metaid_2485" name="cholesterol ester + H2O -&gt; cholesterol + fatty acid" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Activated rat HSL hydrolyzes cholesterol ester to yield cholesterol + fatty acid (Fredrikson et al. 1981). The human reaction has not been studied in detail, and is inferred from the well-characterized rat one.</p>
        </notes>
