      <reaction compartment="compartment_70101" fast="false" id="reaction_209760" metaid="metaid_2491" name="Endocytic translocation of CUBN:GC:25(OH)D to lysosomal lumen" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">The internalized CUBN:GC:25(OH)D complex enters the lysosome where it can be acted upon the protease legumain (Halfon et al. 1998, Chen et al. 2000).</p>
        </notes>
