      <reaction compartment="compartment_70101" fast="false" id="reaction_9031802" metaid="metaid_2506" name="Maresins translocate from cytosol to extracellular region" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">To produce their pro-resolving effects, maresins (MaR1, MaR2, 7(S), 14(S)-diHDHA and 7-epi-MaR1) are released into the exudate of local inflammation sites (Serhan et al. 2015). The mechanism of translocation is unknown.</p>
        </notes>
        <annotation>
