      <reaction compartment="compartment_5460" fast="false" id="reaction_73920" metaid="metaid_2512" name="D-beta hydroxybutyrate+NAD+ &lt;=&gt; acetoacetate+NADH+H+" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">D-beta-hydroxybutyrate dehydrogenase tetramer (BDH1) in the mitochondrial matrix catalyzes the reversible reaction of D-beta hydroxybutyrate and NAD+ to form acetoacetate and NADH + H+ (Marks et al. 1992).</p>
        </notes>
