      <reaction compartment="compartment_17947" fast="false" id="reaction_390402" metaid="metaid_2514" name="Movement of O-hexadecylglycerone phosphate from the peroxisomal matrix to the cytosol" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">O-hexadecylglycerone phosphate is synthesized in the peroxisomal matrix but its further metabolism takes place in the cytosol and endoplasmic reticulum. The mechanism by which it leaves the peroxisome is unknown (Nagan and Zoeller 2001).</p>
        </notes>
        <annotation>
          <rdf:RDF xmlns:rdf="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/" xmlns:vCard="http://www.w3.org/2001/vcard-rdf/3.0#" xmlns:dcterms="http://purl.org/dc/terms/" xmlns:bqbiol="http://biomodels.net/biology-qualifiers/">
