      <reaction compartment="compartment_7660" fast="false" id="reaction_1655835" metaid="metaid_2520" name="Expression of ELOVL6" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">The ELOVL6 gene is transcribed to yield mRNA and the mRNA is translated to yield protein. As inferred from mouse, SREBF1A/1C/2 (SREBP1A/1C/2) bind the promoter of the ELOVL6 gene and enhances transcription (Moon et al. 2001, Matsuzaka et al. 2002, Kumadaki et al. 2008).</p>
        </notes>
