          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">SREBP1A/1C/2 (SREBF1A/1C/2) dimer dissociates from Importin beta-1 in response to Ran-GTP in the nucleoplasm (Nagoshi et al. 1999).</p>
