      <reaction compartment="compartment_70101" fast="false" id="reaction_2161735" metaid="metaid_2528" name="PGC2 is isomerised to PGB2" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Isomerization of the double bond in prostaglandin A2 (PGA2) forms prostaglandin C2 (PGC2). This is an unstable compound which undergoes a second isomerization to yield prostaglandin B2 (PGB2) (Straus and Glass, 2001).</p>
        </notes>
        <annotation>
