      <reaction compartment="compartment_5460" fast="false" id="reaction_77329" metaid="metaid_2529" name="3-Oxooctanoyl-CoA+CoA-SH =&gt; Hexanoyl-CoA + acetyl-CoA" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Trifunctional protein in the mitochondrial matrix converts 3-oxooctanoyl-CoA to hexanoyl-CoA plus acetyl-CoA (Carpenter et al. 1992).</p>
        </notes>
