      <reaction compartment="compartment_12045" fast="false" id="reaction_6807052" metaid="metaid_2530" name="EBP isomerizes ZYMSTNL to LTHSOL" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">EBP (3-beta-hydroxysteroid-Delta(8),Delta(7)-isomerase) associated with the endoplasmic reticulum membrane catalyzes the conversion of ZYMSTNL (zymostenol) to LTHSOL (lathosterol) (Braverman et al. 1999; Derry et al. 1999; Kandutsch and Russell 1960; Mitsche et al. 2015).</p>
        </notes>
        <annotation>
