      <reaction compartment="compartment_70101" fast="false" id="reaction_2161668" metaid="metaid_2541" name="PGA2 is dehydrated to 15d-PGA2" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">The non-enzymatic dehydration of prostaglandin A2 (PGA2) into 15-deoxy prostaglandin A2 (15d-PGA2) which occurs in mice (Petrova et al. 1999) is inferred in humans.</p>
