      <reaction compartment="compartment_17957" fast="false" id="reaction_2161733" metaid="metaid_2543" name="PGD2 is dehydrated to PGJ2" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Analogous to prostaglandin E2 (PGE2), dehydration of the prostaglandin D2 (PGD2) prostane ring forms prostaglandin J2 (PGJ2) (Monneret et al. 2002).</p>
