      <reaction compartment="compartment_70101" fast="false" id="reaction_75900" metaid="metaid_2546" name="1,2-diacyl-glycerol + acyl-CoA =&gt; triacylglycerol + CoASH [DGAT1]" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Tetrameric diacylglycerol O-acyltransferase 1 (DGAT1) associated with the endoplasmic reticulum membrane catalyzes the reaction of 1,2-diacyl-glycerol and acyl-CoA to form triacylglycerol + CoASH (Cheng et al. 2001).</p>
        </notes>
