      <reaction compartment="compartment_70101" fast="false" id="reaction_2161979" metaid="metaid_2547" name="20cho-LTB4 is oxidised to 20cooh-LTB4 by ALDH" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">An aldehyde dehydrogenase (ALDH) yet to be cloned in humans has been observed to oxidise 20-aldehyde leukotriene B4 (20cho-LTB4) to form 20-carboxy leukotriene B4 (20cooh-LTB4) (Sutyak et al. 1989).</p>
        </notes>
