      <reaction compartment="compartment_12045" fast="false" id="reaction_1655834" metaid="metaid_2548" name="SREBP1A,1C,2:SCAP translocates to the Golgi" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">In low concentrations of cholesterol SCAP interacts with Sec24 of the CopII coat complex causing SCAP:SREBP1A/1C/2 to be transported with the CopII complex from the endoplasmic reticulum to the Golgi.</p>
        </notes>
