      <reaction compartment="compartment_70101" fast="false" id="reaction_548814" metaid="metaid_2552" name="ELOVL3,6,7 elongate PALM-CoA and Mal-CoA to 3OOD-CoA" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">The ER membrane-bound elongation of very long chain fatty acids proteins 3, 6 and 7 (ELOVL3,6,7) catalyse the condensation of palmitoyl-CoA (PALM-CoA) with malonyl-CoA (Mal-CoA) to form 3-oxooctadecanoyl-CoA (3OOD-CoA) (Shimamura et al. 2009, Ohno et al. 2010, Naganuma et al. 2011).</p>
        </notes>
        <annotation>
          <rdf:RDF xmlns:rdf="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/" xmlns:vCard="http://www.w3.org/2001/vcard-rdf/3.0#" xmlns:dcterms="http://purl.org/dc/terms/" xmlns:bqbiol="http://biomodels.net/biology-qualifiers/">
