      <reaction compartment="compartment_7660" fast="false" id="reaction_2426154" metaid="metaid_2556" name="SREBP1A,2 binds the LSS promoter" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">SREBP1A (SREBF1A) or SREBP2 binds and transactivates the promoter of the LSS gene (Pai et al. 1998, Rome et al. 2008). SREBP1A and SREBP2 activate LSS equally (Pai et al. 1998).</p>
        </notes>
