      <reaction compartment="compartment_876" fast="false" id="reaction_1676164" metaid="metaid_2557" name="PI(3,4)P2 is dephosphorylated to PI3P by INPP4A/B at the plasma membrane" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">At the plasma membrane, type I and type II inositol-3,4-bisphosphate 4-phosphatase (INPP4A) (Norris et al. 1995, Ivetac et al. 2005) and (INPP4B) (Norris et al. 1997) dephosphorylate phosphatidylinositol 3,4-bisphosphate (PI(3,4)P2) to phosphatidylinositol 3-phosphate (PI3P).</p>
        </notes>
        <annotation>
