      <reaction compartment="compartment_5460" fast="false" id="reaction_192054" metaid="metaid_2565" name="3alpha,7alpha,12alpha-trihydroxy-5beta-cholestan-27-al is oxidized to 3alpha,7alpha,12alpha-trihydroxy-5beta-cholestanoate (THCA)" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">3alpha,7alpha,12alpha-trihydroxy-5beta-cholestan-27-al, NADPH + H+, and O2 react to form 3alpha,7alpha,12alpha-trihydroxy-5beta-cholestanoate (THCA), NADP+, and H2O. This oxidation reaction occurs in the mitochondrial matrix, catalyzed by CYP27A1.</p>
        </notes>
