      <reaction compartment="compartment_5460" fast="false" id="reaction_77319" metaid="metaid_2566" name="Butanoyl-CoA+FAD =&gt; Crotonoyl-CoA+FADH2" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">ACADS in the mitochondrial matrix dehydrogenates butanoyl-CoA to form (2E)-butenoyl-CoA (crotonoyl-CoA). (Krane and Beinert 1956; Finocchiaro et al. 1987).</p>
        </notes>
