      <reaction compartment="compartment_7660" fast="false" id="reaction_1655830" metaid="metaid_2573" name="Expression of Acetyl CoA Carboxylase 2 (ACACB, ACC2)" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">The ACACB gene is transcribed to yield mRNA and the mRNA is translated to yield protein. As inferred from rat, SREBF1 binds promoter II of the Acetyl-CoA carboxylase 2 gene (ACACB, ACC2) and enhances transcription (Oh et al. 2003).</p>
        </notes>
