      <reaction compartment="compartment_876" fast="false" id="reaction_1606273" metaid="metaid_2580" name="SMPD2 and 3 hydrolyze sphingomyelin (plasma membrane)" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">The mammalian brain-specific, Mg2+-dependent, neutral sphingomyelin phosphodiesterases 2 (Tomiuk et al. 1998, Hofmann et al. 2000) and 3 (Marchesini et al. 2003) (SMPD2 and 3) hydrolyse sphingomyelin (SPHM) to ceramide (CERA) at the plasma membrane.</p>
        </notes>
