      <reaction compartment="compartment_17951" fast="false" id="reaction_389580" metaid="metaid_2583" name="formyl-CoA + H2O =&gt; formate + CoASH" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Formyl-CoA formed during the alpha-oxidation of phytanoyl-CoA is spontaneously hydrolyzed to formate and CoASH (Croes et al. 1997).</p>
        </notes>
