      <reaction compartment="compartment_70101" fast="false" id="reaction_1483002" metaid="metaid_2584" name="DHAP is converted to 1-acyl GO3P by GNPAT" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Dihydroxyacetone phosphate (DHAP) is converted to 1-acyl glycerone 3-phosphate (GO3P) by the enzyme dihydroxyacetone phosphate acyltransferase (GNPAT) (de Vet et al. 1999, Ofman et al. 1994). This reaction step links Glycerolipid metabolism to Ether lipid metabolism.</p>
        </notes>
        <annotation>
