      <reaction compartment="compartment_5460" fast="false" id="reaction_77345" metaid="metaid_2589" name="Decanoyl-CoA+FAD =&gt; trans-Dec-2-enoyl-CoA+FADH2" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">ACADM in the mitochondrial matrix dehydrogenates decanoyl-CoA to form trans-dec-2-enoyl-CoA. (Krane and Beinert 1956; Finocchiaro et al. 1987).</p>
