      <reaction compartment="compartment_70101" fast="false" id="reaction_9026411" metaid="metaid_2592" name="13(R)-HDPAn-3 translocates from endothelial cell to neutrophil" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">13(R)-hydroxy-docosapentaenoic acid (13(R)-DPAn-3) translocates from endothelial cells to adhered neutrophils, where it can be oxidised further (Dalli et al. 2015, Primdahl et al. 2016).</p>
        </notes>
