      <reaction compartment="compartment_5460" fast="false" id="reaction_109343" metaid="metaid_2599" name="Reduction of 2-trans-4-cis-decadienoyl-CoA to form 3-trans-decenoyl-CoA" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">The second of the two accessory enzymes, 2,4-dienoyl-CoA reductase catalyses an oxidation-reduction (redox) reaction to yield 3-trans-decenoyl-CoA.</p>
        </notes>
