      <reaction compartment="compartment_70616" fast="false" id="reaction_1483063" metaid="metaid_2601" name="PG and CDP-DAG are converted to CL by CRLS1" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">At the inner mitochondrial membrane (IM), cardiolipin synthase (CRLS1) converts phosphatidylglycerol (PG) and cytidine diphosphate-diacylglycerol (CDP-DAG) into cardiolipin (CL) (Lu et al. 2006, Houtkooper et al. 2006).</p>
        </notes>
