      <reaction compartment="compartment_70101" fast="false" id="reaction_8949399" metaid="metaid_2607" name="CAR translocates from the cytosol to the mitochondrial intermembrane space" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">CAR (carnitine) diffuses across the mitochondrial outer membrane from the cytosol to the mitochondrial intermembrane space, presumably via porin channels in the outer membrane (Bay and Court 2002).</p>
        </notes>
        <annotation>
