      <reaction compartment="compartment_7660" fast="false" id="reaction_4546387" metaid="metaid_2609" name="PIAS4 SUMOylates VDR with SUMO2" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">E3 SUMO-protein ligase (PIAS4) SUMOylates Vitamin D3 receptor (VDR) with SUMO2 (Jena et al. 2012). SUMOylation inhibits transcriptional activation by VDR in response to vitamin D.</p>
        </notes>
        <annotation>
