      <reaction compartment="compartment_20699" fast="false" id="reaction_1675815" metaid="metaid_2617" name="PI4P transports from the Golgi membrane to the plasma membrane" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Phosphatidylinositol 4-phosphate (PI4P) translocates from the Golgi membrane to the plasma membrane via a secretory vesicle mechanism (Szentpetery et al. 2010, Godi et al. 2004, Hammond et al. 2009).</p>
        </notes>
