      <reaction compartment="compartment_70101" fast="false" id="reaction_1605768" metaid="metaid_2627" name="NEU3 cleaves GM3 to form LacCer (plasma membrane)" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Sialidase-3 (NEU3) cleaves Neu5Ac from GM3 in the plasma membrane. NEU3 is thought to play a role in modulating the ganglioside content of the lipid bilayer (Monti et al. 2000).</p>
        </notes>
