      <reaction compartment="compartment_12045" fast="false" id="reaction_1482857" metaid="metaid_2632" name="CL transports from the ER to the IM" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Cardiolipin (CL) transports via membrane contact sites between the endoplasmic reticulum (ER) and the inner mitochondria membranes (IM) (Osman et al. 2011, Vance 1990, Gaigg et al. 1995, Zhao et al. 2009, Simbeni et al. 1991, Ardail et al. 1993, Shiao et al., 1995).</p>
        </notes>
        <annotation>
          <rdf:RDF xmlns:rdf="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/" xmlns:vCard="http://www.w3.org/2001/vcard-rdf/3.0#" xmlns:dcterms="http://purl.org/dc/terms/" xmlns:bqbiol="http://biomodels.net/biology-qualifiers/">
