      <reaction compartment="compartment_17947" fast="false" id="reaction_390393" metaid="metaid_2643" name="Peroxisomal uptake of very long-chain fatty acyl CoA" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">ABCD1 (ATP-binding cassette sub-family D member 1) mediates the ATP-dependent, coupled peroxisomal import and hydrolysis of cytosolic very long chain fatty-acyl-CoA to form peroxisomal very long-chain fatty acid and CoASH (Kawaguchi et al. 2021; van Roermund et al. 2011; van Roermund et al. 2012).</p>
        </notes>
