      <reaction compartment="compartment_7660" fast="false" id="reaction_2426160" metaid="metaid_2652" name="SREBP1A,1C binds the ACACA promoter" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">SREBP1A (SREBF1A) or SREBP1C bind two sites in the promoter of the ACACA gene (Magana et al. 1997, Rome et al. 2008). Each site is required for activation of transcription.</p>
        </notes>
        <annotation>
          <rdf:RDF xmlns:rdf="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/" xmlns:vCard="http://www.w3.org/2001/vcard-rdf/3.0#" xmlns:dcterms="http://purl.org/dc/terms/" xmlns:bqbiol="http://biomodels.net/biology-qualifiers/">
            <rdf:Description rdf:about="#metaid_2652">
              <dc:creator>
