      <reaction compartment="compartment_70101" fast="false" id="reaction_191422" metaid="metaid_2660" name="Mevalonate-5-phosphate is further phosphorylated" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Cytosolic phosphomevalonate kinase (PMK) catalyzes the reversible, ATP-dependent phosphorylation of mevalonate-5-phosphate (MVA5P), producing mevalonate-5-pyrophosphate (MVA5PP) (Herdendorf and Miziorko 2006; Hogenboom et al. 2004; ).</p>
        </notes>
        <annotation>
