      <reaction compartment="compartment_5460" fast="false" id="reaction_77309" metaid="metaid_2664" name="3-Oxododecanoyl-CoA+CoA-SH =&gt; Decanoyl-CoA + acetyl-CoA" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Trifunctional protein in the mitochondrial matrix converts 3-oxolauroyl-CoA to decanoyl-CoA plus acetyl-CoA (Carpenter et al. 1992).</p>
