      <reaction compartment="compartment_70616" fast="false" id="reaction_1482759" metaid="metaid_2665" name="MLCL is hydrolyzed to DLCL by PLA2G4A (IM)" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">At the inner mitochondrial membrane (IM), the phospholipase A2 group IV alpha (PLA2G4A) protein hydrolyzes monolysocardiolipin (MLCL) and produces dilysocardiolipin (DLCL) (Buckland et al. 1998, Sharp et al. 1994).</p>
        </notes>
        <annotation>
          <rdf:RDF xmlns:rdf="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/" xmlns:vCard="http://www.w3.org/2001/vcard-rdf/3.0#" xmlns:dcterms="http://purl.org/dc/terms/" xmlns:bqbiol="http://biomodels.net/biology-qualifiers/">
