      <reaction compartment="compartment_70101" fast="false" id="reaction_2161962" metaid="metaid_2693" name="LTA4 is hydrolysed to 6t-/6t,12epi-LTB4" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Non-enzymatic hydrolysis of the leukotriene A4 (LTA4) epoxide bond creates 6-trans leukotriene B4 (6t-LTB4) and 6-trans,12-epi leukotriene B4 (6t,12epi-LTB4) stereoisomers (Mansour and Agha 1999, Sirois et al. 1985).</p>
        </notes>
        <annotation>
