      <reaction compartment="compartment_12045" fast="false" id="reaction_9946140" metaid="metaid_2697" name="TM7SF2 reduces 4,4-diMeCholesta-8,14-dien-3-ol to 4,4-diMe5-cholest-8-en-3-ol" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">TM7SF2 (Delta(14)-sterol reductase Transmembrane 7 superfamily member 2), localized to the endoplasmic reticulum membrane, reduces 4,4-diMeCholesta-8,14-dien-3-ol to 4,4-diMe-5-cholest-8-en-3-ol (Bennati et al. 2006).</p>
        </notes>
