      <reaction compartment="compartment_12045" fast="false" id="reaction_2161814" metaid="metaid_2705" name="Arachidonate is hydroxylated to 19-HETE by CYP(2)" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Several cytochrome P450s (CYPs) convert arachidonate to 19-hydroxyeicosatetraenoic acid (19-HETE). The CYPs and their references are as follows: CYP2C8 (Bylund et al. 1998); CYP2C9 (Bylund et al. 1998); CYP2C19 (Bylund et al. 1998); CYP4A11 (Gainer et al. 2005); CYP2U1 (Chuang et al. 2004); CYP1A1, CYP1A2, CYP1B1 (Choudhary et al. 2004).</p>
        </notes>
        <annotation>
          <rdf:RDF xmlns:rdf="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/" xmlns:vCard="http://www.w3.org/2001/vcard-rdf/3.0#" xmlns:dcterms="http://purl.org/dc/terms/" xmlns:bqmodel="http://biomodels.net/model-qualifiers/" xmlns:bqbiol="http://biomodels.net/biology-qualifiers/">
