      <reaction compartment="compartment_17951" fast="false" id="reaction_9914143" metaid="metaid_2706" name="SLC27A2-mediated ligation of peroxisomal fatty acid and CoASH" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">SLC27A1 (Long-chain fatty acid transport protein 1) catalyzes the ATP-dependent ligation of a very long-chain fatty acid and CoASH to form a very long-chain fatty acyl-CoA (Steinberg et al. 1999).</p>
        </notes>
