      <reaction compartment="compartment_12045" fast="false" id="reaction_6807242" metaid="metaid_2709" name="25(OH)D translocates from ER membrane to extracellular region" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">25-hydroxyvitamin D (calcidiol, 25(OH)D) translocates to the extracellular region (Verboven et al. 2002).</p>
        </notes>
