      <reaction compartment="compartment_17963" fast="false" id="reaction_9846501" metaid="metaid_2710" name="B3GNT5 transfers GlcNAc to LacCer" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Lactosylceramide 1,3-N-acetyl-beta-D-glucosaminyltransferase (B3GNT5) transfers a N-acetylglucosaminyl (GlcNAc) moiety from UDP-GlcNAc to lactosylceramide, to form lactotriaosylceramide (Lc3Cer), the precursor to lacto- or neolacto-series glycolipids, which are intermediates in the biosynthesis of HNK-1 and Lewis X carbohydrate residues (Togayachi et al., 2001; Togayachi et al., 2010).</p>
        </notes>
        <annotation>
          <rdf:RDF xmlns:rdf="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/" xmlns:vCard="http://www.w3.org/2001/vcard-rdf/3.0#" xmlns:dcterms="http://purl.org/dc/terms/" xmlns:bqbiol="http://biomodels.net/biology-qualifiers/">
