      <reaction compartment="compartment_70101" fast="false" id="reaction_9023980" metaid="metaid_2713" name="18(S)-RvE1, E2 and E3 translocate from cytosol to extracellular region" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">To produce their pro-resolving effects, 18(S)-RvE1, E2 and E3 are released into the exudate of local inflammation sites (Serhan et al. 2000). The mechanism of translocation is unknown.</p>
        </notes>
        <annotation>
