      <reaction compartment="compartment_7660" fast="false" id="reaction_1655827" metaid="metaid_2716" name="Expression of 7-Dehydrocholesterol Reductase (DHCR7)" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">The DHCR7 gene is transcribed to yield mRNA and the mRNA is translated to yield protein. SREBF1A (SREBP1A) and SREBF2 (SREBP2) bind the promoter of the 7-Dehydrocholesterol Reductase (DHCR) gene and enhance transcription (Sakakura et al. 2001, Reed et al. 2008, reviewed in Horton et al. 2002).</p>
        </notes>
