      <reaction compartment="compartment_5460" fast="false" id="reaction_77304" metaid="metaid_2749" name="3-Oxopalmitoyl-CoA+CoA-SH =&gt; myristoyl-CoA+acetyl-CoA" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Trifunctional protein in the mitochondrial matrix converts 3-oxopalmitoyl-CoA to myristoyl-CoA plus acetyl-CoA (Carpenter et al. 1992).</p>
