      <reaction compartment="compartment_5460" fast="false" id="reaction_77333" metaid="metaid_2756" name="trans-Oct-2-enoyl-CoA+H2O =&gt; (S)-Hydroxyoctanoyl-CoA" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">ECHS1 in the mitochondrial matrix hydrates trans-oct-2-enoyl-CoA to form (S)-3-hydroxyoctanoyl-CoA (Stern and Del Campillo 1956).</p>
