      <reaction compartment="compartment_5460" fast="false" id="reaction_193393" metaid="metaid_2765" name="5beta-cholestan-3alpha, 7alpha-diol is hydroxylated to 5beta-cholestan-3alpha, 7alpha, 26-triol" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">5beta-cholestan-3alpha, 7alpha-diol, NADPH + H+, and O2 react to form 5beta-cholestan-3alpha, 7alpha, 26-triol + NADP+ + H2O. This reaction occurs in the mitochondrial matrix, catalyzed by CYP27A1.</p>
        </notes>
