      <reaction compartment="compartment_5460" fast="false" id="reaction_193965" metaid="metaid_2771" name="CYP11B2 oxidises 18HCORST to ALDO" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">18-Hydroxycorticosterone and NADPH + H+ react to form aldosterone, NADP+, and H2O. This reaction is catalyzed by CYP11B2 associated with the inner mitochondrial membrane.</p>
        </notes>
