      <reaction compartment="compartment_7660" fast="false" id="reaction_2426144" metaid="metaid_2773" name="SREBP1A,2 binds the MVD promoter" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">SREBP1A (SREBF1A) or SREBP2 binds and transactivates the promoter of the MVD gene (Rome et al. 2008).</p>
