      <reaction compartment="compartment_17957" fast="false" id="reaction_2309787" metaid="metaid_2778" name="Arachidonate is oxidised to PGG2 by PTGS2" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Prostaglandin G/H synthase PTGS2 exhibits a dual catalytic activity, a cyclooxygenase and a peroxidase. The cyclooxygenase function catalyzes the initial conversion of arachidonate to an intermediate, prostaglandin G2 (PGG2) (Hamberg et al. 1974, Nugteren 1973).</p>
        </notes>
