      <reaction compartment="compartment_5460" fast="false" id="reaction_109998" metaid="metaid_2779" name="Isomerization of 3-trans-decenoyl-CoA to form trans-dec-2-enoyl-CoA" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Once the second of the two double bonds has been reached 3,2-trans-enoyl-CoA isomerase, changes the spatial conformation of the second double bond from cis to trans. This step yields trans-dec-2-enoyl-CoA, which then enters the saturated beta-oxidation pathway.</p>
        </notes>
        <annotation>
